<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Mathiu</book>
  <para style="h">Mathiu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mathiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mathiu</para>
  <para style="mt">Mathiu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham tapa, David tapa, Jesu Khrist khanggui kisutna laibu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham tapa Isaak ahia, Isaak tapa Jakob ahia, Jakob tapa Juda leh asanggam pasalte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamar akipat a Juda tapate Perez leh Zerah ahi a, Perez tapa Hezron, Hezron tapa Ram ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram tapa Aminadab ahia, Amminadab tapa Nahshon ahia, Nahshon tapa Salmon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salmon tapa Rahab akipat in Boaz ahia, Boaz tapa Ruth akipat in Obed ahia, Obed tapa Jesse ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tualeh Jesse tapa David leengpa ahia, Lengpa David tapa Uria zi lah a kipat in Solomon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon tapa Rehoboam ahia, Rehoboam tapa Abijah ahia, tualeh Abijah tapa Asa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa tapa Jehoshaphat ahia, Jehoshaphat tapa Joram ahia, tualeh Joram tapa Uzziah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzziah tapa Jotham ahia, Jotham tapa Ahaz ahia, Ahaz tapa Hezekiah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah tapa Manasseh ahia, Manasseh tapa Amon ahia tualeh Amon tapa Josiah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babilon lam a sal a apuimang lai vel un Josiah in Jekoniah leh asanggamte ahing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Babilon lam a sal a puimanga aum nua ua Jekoniah tapa Shealtiel ahia, Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerubbabel tapa Abiud ahia, Abiud tapa Eliakim ahia, tualeh Eliakim tapa Azor ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azor tapa Zadok ahia, Zadok tapa Akim ahia, tualeh Akim tapa Eliud ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eliud tapa Eleazar ahia, Eleazar tapa Matthan ahia, tualeh Matthan tapa Jakob ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakob tapa Mari pasal Joseph ahia, tua Mari apat in Khrist kichi Jesu ahing pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n khang zousie Abraham akipat David dongchieng khangsawm leh khang li ahia, David akipat a Babilon gama sal a puimanga aum dong chieng uh, khang sawm leh khang li ahia, tualeh Babilon gama sal a puimang a aum ua kipat Khrist dong chieng khang sawm leh khangli ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin Jesu Khrist hing pien dan hichi bang ahi: Anu Mari khu Joseph toh akikham lai ua, a umkhawm masang un, Hagau Siengthouin nau apaisahta chi akitheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n apasal Joseph midihtah ahia, zapi mai a amanu zumsuo ding a utlou ziehin, aguh a tawpsan atumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh ama’n tam thute angaituo laiin, Ngai vawi, amangin akung ah, Mangpa vansawlsieng khat ahing kilah a, “David tapa Joseph, na zi khamlai Mari kitenpi ding zau sin, anau pailai khu Hagau Siengthoua paisah ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amanu’n tapa khat hing nei van in, amin Jesu na phuo ding hi, Aman a mite akhelna ua kipat ahundam ding zieh in,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin tamte zousie Mangpa’n a guolnei kam a ana gente atangtun theina dinga hing um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ngai un, nungah siengthou agai ding a, tapa anei dinga, amin Immanuel achi ding uhi”, tua khu ikungah “Pasian a um china ahi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joseph imu lai athou a, Mangpa vansawlsieng in thu apieh bangin abawl a, azi akitenpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh amanu’n atapa masa pen anei khieh masang sie’n aluppi sih hi. Tualeh amin Jesu aphuota uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin leengpa Herod in vai ahawm lai a, Judia gam a Bethlehem khuo a Jesu ahing pien in, En vawi, suolam akipat in mipilte Jerusalem ah ahing pei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Judate leengpa hing pienna heisung ahiei? Suolam ah aasi ka mu ua, Ama be dinga hing pei ka hi uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lengpa Herod in tam thute azahtah in alungbuoita a tualeh Jerusalem mite zousie zong ama toh abuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh siempu liente leh mipite laigielmite zousie ahankhawm a, Khrist hing pienna ding heisung ahiei chi’n adongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah “Judia gam a Bethlehem khuo ah; azieh pen guolnei in tambang in ana giel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Nang Juda gam a Bethlehem, Juda khopite lah ah na neupen vawt sih hi, Nang akipat in vaihawmpa khat hing pieng ding ahizieh in, ka mi Israelte vengpa dingin, akichi hi,’ achi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Herod in mipilte adap hat a, aasi kilat hun kichientah in akankheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Bethlehem ah asawl a, “Peita unlen naungeh thu kichientah in va kankhie un, tualeh na mu tah chieng un hing hil kia un, kei zong hing pei a ka hing bieh thei sam na dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lengpa thu azah nua un apeita uhi, tualeh en vawi, suolam a amu uh aasi khu naungeh umna tung zawn atun a akhawlden masangsie’n amasang uah apei zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aasi amu tah un nasatah a nuom in akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Innsunga aluttah un, naungeh anu Mari toh um amu ua, tualeh akhupboh ua, abeta uhi. Tualeh a goubawmte uh ahong ua, akungah sana, begaw, leh Murrahte apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Herod kung a kile kia lou dinga amang ua, vauhil a aum zieh un, lampi tuom zui in agam lam uah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin amauh pei nua in, en vawi, Mangpa vansawlsieng khat Joseph kungah amang in ahing ki laha, “Thou inlen naungeh leh anu pui inlen Izipt gam ah taipi in, tualeh ka hing hil kia masangsie tuanah umden in, Herod in naungeh tha dinga sui ding ahi ziehin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n athou pai a, naungeh leh anu a pui a azan azan in Izipt gam lam ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Herod a shi masangsiein khunah aumdenta hi; Mangpa’n guolnei kam a, “Ka tapa Izipt gam a kipat ka handohta hi,” chi a agen ahing tangtun theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Herod in mipilten asol uh chi atheitah in alungthah mama a, mi asawl a, mipilte kunga ahun thu kichientah a adoh khieh bangtahin, Bethlehem khuo leh akim avel a pasal naupang kum ni nuoi lam zousie athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Jeremiah thugen khu tua hun laitah in atang tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Khum hunlai in guolnei Jeremiah in, Ramah khuo ah aw akiza, mishi ngai a kaa leh mauna, Rachel in atate akaa a, a umnawn lou zieh un, hamuon thei ahi sih,” chia a gen khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Herod ashi bep in, Ngai in, Mangpa vansawlsieng khat Izipt gam a Joseph kungah amangin ava kilah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Thou inlen naungeh leh anu pui inlen, Israel gam ah pei in, naungeh tha tumte ashitah zieh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n athou a naungeh leh anu apui a, Israel gam ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Arkelaus khu apa Herod tangin Juda gam ah vai ahawm chi azah in khum lang a pei ding azauta hi. Tualeh amanga Pasian in athuhil ziehin Galili gam lam ah akile hei a apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Nazareth kichi khuo khat ah a umta hi; guolneiten “Ama khu Nazareth mi” achi ding uh chia agen uh atangtun theina dingin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hunlaiin Baptispa Johan khu Judia gamdai ah thu genin ahing pei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kisia un, vangam anaita hi!” achiin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ahi, Guolnei Isai in, “Gamdai a mi kikou aw in, Mangpa lamlien siel unlen, alampite sutang un, achi hi,” chia a nagen khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh tua Johan in sangawngsau mul puon asil a, akawng savun kawnggahin agah a, a ann khu khaukhup leh gam khuoizu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem leh Judia gam pumpi leh Jordan gamkai kimvel a um mi zousie akungah ahing pei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />akhelnate uh thupha tawiin, Jordan lui ah ama kungah baptisma atangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman Pharisaite leh Saddukaite tampi akunga baptisma tang dinga hing pei amu tahin akung uah “Nou gul suonte aw, lungthahna hing tung ding taisan ding a hing thuhil koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuazieh in kisiana min potaahin ga suong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Abraham ka pu uh ahi chi’n kingaituo sih un, Pasian in tam suongte zong Abraham hahlesuonte in adingsah thei hi, chi’n ka hing hil ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh tuin zong sing bul chin ah heipi koi ahita hi. Tuaziehin sing chin ga hoia ga lou pouma akiphua a mei ah akipailut zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ken kisiana dingin noute tuiin ka hing baptis ngei a, hinanleh ka nua a hing pei ding pa kei sangin athupizaw a, akedap tawitah zong ka hi sih hi; Aman Hagau Siengthou leh mei in ahing baptis ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akhut ah a phazap atawi a, aphuol a bute azap chiil dinga, bu pangah abute asungkhawm ding a hinanleh bushite pen mei mit theilou in ahaltum ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu, Johan kunga baptisma tang dingin Galili gam akipat in Jordan lui ah ahing pei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Johan in Nang, “Kei na hing baptis kiphamawzaw hinapi a, kei kunga hing peizawsop ding na hiei mah? chiin ana kham tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n a dawnga akungah, “Tuin pha sain, tambanga dihtatna zousie bawl bukim ei a dingin ahoi hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n pha asata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n baptisma atan zouin, tui akipat in apawtdoh pai a, tualeh Ngai vawi, van khu ama dingin ahing kihong a, Pasian Hagau vakhu banga hing kumsuh in atunga hing tu khu amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, thakhat in van a kipat in aw khat in, “Tami ka tapa deita, ka kipahna mama ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu dawimangpa sol aum dingin gamdai ah Hagau puilut in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh sun sawm li leh zan sawmli anngawl a a um nua in agil ahing kielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n asoldingpa ahing pei a, akungah, “Pasian tapa na hileh tam suongte tanghou suohsah dingin thu pie in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman adawnga akungah, “Mihing tanghou guoh in ahing sih dinga, Pasian kam a thu chin pawtin ahingzaw ding, chi gel ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n dawimangpa’n Ama khopi siengthou ah apuitou a, Pasian biehinn khumvum ah akoi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tualeh akungah, Pasian tapa na hileh kesuhin aziehpen tambanga gel ahi: “Na tungtang thu ah Aman avansawlsiengte thu ape dinga, akhut un ahing na dom tou ding uh, tuachilouin na kengin suong khat asuikha ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu’n akung ah, “Mangpa na Pasian ze et sin chi gel ahi kia hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh dawimangpa’n ama khu muol sangtah tung khat ah azawpitou kia a, leitung leenggam zousie leh athupina uh a ensah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tualeh akung ah, “Khupboh a na hing bieh leh tamte zousie ka hing pe ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Tana kipat in peimang in Setan, Mangpa na Pasian na be dinga, Ama nna bou nasep ding ahi, chi gel ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n diabol in, anuasieta a, tualeh Ngai vawi, Vansawlsiengte ahing pei ua, ana aseppiehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin Johan suongkul ah akhum uh chi Jesu’n azahtah in Galili gam lam ah akihemkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Nazareth khuo nuasie in, Zebulun leh Naphtali gamkai sunga, tuipi gei a um Kapernaum khuo ah ava tengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Guolnei Isai in, tambanga athugente ahing tangtun theina ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuipi lam a Jordan gal a Zebulun gam leh Naphtali gam, Jentelte Galili!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miel lah a touten vah thupitah amuta, shina gam leh lim a toute tungah, khovah ahing suohta hi,” ana chi khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum huna kipat in Jesu’n “Kisia un van gam anaita hi, chi’n thugen apanta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu Galili tuipi gei a avah laiin Simon kichi Peter leh asanggampa Andru, tuipi a lensep a um amu a, ama uh nga man mi mawng ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Hing zui un, mihing manin ka hing bawl ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n a maun alente uh anuasie pai ua, Ama azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh khuna kipat in apei zela, unau dang ni Zebedi tapate Jakob leh asanggampa Johan apa u’toh kuong sunga alente uh phaw a um amu a, tualeh amauh ahan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tualeh amaun kuong leh apa uh anuasie pai ua, Ama azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu Galili gam pumpi ah apei kawi kawi a, akikhopna innte uah, leenggam khantanhoi thu agen a, mite lah a natna chinteng leh damlouna chinteng, adam sah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria gam pumpi ah aminthangta a, tualeh amaun natna chi tuom tuom a damlou zousie leh dawi matte buhshite, zengte, akungah ahing pui ua, Aman ana sudam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Galili akipat, Dekapolis akipat, Jerusalem akipat, Judia gam leh Jordan gallam a kipat in mi tampiin Ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh mipite amuin muol tungah apeitou a, atou a, anuazuite akungah ahing pei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akam akaah a, amauh thu ahil a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hagau a gentheite ahampha uhi, van gam ama-ua ahi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Da a lungkhamte ahampha uh, hamuon a um ding ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Lungnemte ahampha uh, lei gouluo ding ahizieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Dihtatna zieh a gilkiel leh, dangtate ahampha uh, tai ding ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mi hepi siemte ahampha uh, hepina mu ding ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Lungsim a siengthoute ahampha uh, Pasian mu ding ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Lemna bawlte ahampha uh, Pasian tate chi a um ding ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Dihtatna zieh a gawtna thuohte ahampha uh, van gam ama ua ding ahi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Miten keima zieh a ahing housiet ua, ahing bawlsiet ua, zuou a sietna chinteng a ahing heh hun chieng un, na hampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kipah unlen, nasatah in nuom un, van ah na nuom man ding uh athupi mama hi, tuamabangin na masang ua guolnei umte zong ana bawlgenthei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Noute lei chi na hi uhi, hinanleh chi khu tamta leh bang achi ki al sah kiata diei? tuachi’n paidoh a mite totchil ding loungal in bangma dingin aphatuom nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Noute leitung vah na hi uhi, muol tunga khopi um khu akiphuol thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi’n meivah dein law nuoi ah akoi ngai sih ua, atunna tungah akoizaw uhi; tuachi’n inn sunga mi um zousie ataanvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuama bangin na vah uh mi mudingin vah heh, tuachi’n na silbawl hoite amu thei ding ua, Van a um na Pa uh apahtawi thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Dan thu leh guolneite thu sumang dinga hing pei ahi chiin hing ngaisut sih un, asumang dinga hing pei ka hi sih a, asutangtung dinga hing pei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chitahtahin na kung uah ka gen ahi, lei leh van aman masangsiein, danthu apat sutvom neunoukhat ahiei, thaivom neunoukhat zong amang sih ding hi, abawn a atangtun kim masangsiein.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuazieh in koihinanleh tam thupiehte laha neupen khat maimai zong susie a, tuabanga bawl dinga mite thuhil pouma vangam ah mi neupen akichi ding hi; hinanleh azui a tualeh tuabanga zui dinga mite thuhil pouma vangam ah milien akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen ka hing hil ahi, Na dihtatna un laigiel mite leh Pharisaite dihtatna akhup sih leh vangam ah na lut vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nidanglai a mite kunga tuol na thalou ding ahi, tualeh koizong tuolthat pouma vaihawmna zauhuoitah dinmun ah ading ding uh kichi na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh ken na kung uah ka gen ahi, Koipou azieh bei a a unau tunga lungthah khu thukhenna zauhuoi dinmun ah ading ding a, tualeh koi zong a unau kunga Raka chi pouma thukhen vaihawmte vaihawmkhumna zauhuoitah dinmun ah ading ding a, tualeh koipou “Nang mi mo” chi pouma gawtmun meidil a pai ding zauhuoitah dinmun ah a ding ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin maitam bul a na silpieh na lat laitah a, na unau in na tunga lungkimlouna anei chi na theidoh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />na silpieh khu maitam mai ah nuasie inlen, pei inlen na unau toh kilem masa phot inlen, tuachi’n hing pei inlen na silpieh lan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na langpa toh thukhenna lam zuon a lampi a na peikhawm lai un, kilempi zuai in, tua ahisihleh na langpa’n thukhenmi khut ah ahing pe dinga, thukhen miin, mi manpa khut ah ahingpe dinga, tualeh mi manpan suongkul ah ahing khum kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hinghil ahi, paisa san khat nangawn na pieh kim masangsie tuana kipat in na pawtdoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nidang lai a mite kunga, ang na kawm ding uh ahisih kichi na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh Ken vang na kung ua ka gen ahi, koipou in numei khat mawpi utna toh a et leh alungsim ah amanu toh ang akawm zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh na mit zietlam in ahing khelsah leh kheukhie inlen pai mai in, na tahsa pumpi gawtmuna pai ahi sangin na tahsa hieng khat amanthai nang a dingin ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh na khut zietlam in ahing khelsah leh sattan inlen nanga kipat paimangin, na tahsa pumpi gawtmuna pai ahi sangin na tahsa hieng khat amanthai nang ading in ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tuaban ah koizong zi khul pouma in khulna lai amanu pie heh, ana kichi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh ken vang na kung uah ka gen ahi: Mi koipou in mi toh lupkhawm zieh hilou a, azi akhul leh amanu angkawm sah ahi tualeh koipou tua khulsanu kitenpi khu angkawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tuachiengin nidanglai, in mite kunga zuouin kichiem sinlen, hinanleh na kichiemnate Mangpa kungah tangtunzaw in, kichi zong na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh ken vang na kung uah ka gen ahi: Kichiem mawngmawng sih un, van lou in kichiem sih un, tua khu Pasian Mangtoupha ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahisihleh lei louin zong kichiem sih un, tua khu akeng ngapna ahi, ahisihleh Jerusalem louin zong kichiem sih un, tua khu leengpa thupitah khopi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na lutang lou a na kichiem ding zong ahi tuom sih, aziehpen na samzam khat zong na kang sahin, na vomsah thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh na thugen uh ahite ahi, ahiloute ahilou hi mai heh, akan aval pen gitlouna lah a hing pawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Mit taangin mit, ha taangin ha, ana kichi na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh ken ka hing hil ahi, migilou thuh sih un, hinanleh koipou in na bieng zietlam abeh u’leh, alelam zong dawzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh mi koipou in na tunga thusie bawl a na puonah lah atup leh na puongjal zong lasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh koipou tai khat pei dinga hing paubawlte kungah ama toh tai ni peikhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mi’n na kunga ang nget leh pie inlen, tualeh ahing leitawi ut leh, kiheimangsan sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Na innvengte it inlen, na melmate muda in kichi na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hinanleh kenvang na kung uah ka gen ahi, na melmate uh it unlen, nou hing bawlseta thungetpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n na Pa uh van a um tate na hi thei ding uhi; Aman migiloute leh mi hoite tungah ni asuohsah a, tualeh midihtat leh midihtat loute tungah zong guo azusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nou hing itte beh na it uleh kipahman bang ahiei na mu ding uh? Siedongte nangawn in zong tuabang a bawl hilou ahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh na unaute beh uh chibai na buh u’leh midangte sang a bang ahiei na bawl tam tuom uh? Siedongte nangawn in zong tuabanga bawl hilou ahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuazieh in van a um na Pa uh ahoibukim mabangin noute zong hoibukim un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na sil hoi bawlte uh mihingte mitmu a amasang ua bawllou dingin pilvang un, tuachilouin pen na Pa uh van a um kungah nuomman muding na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuaziehin mi kunga silpieh na pieh chieng un mi lepchieten mi pahtat alawtheina ding ua, kikhopna inn leh kholaidung lah a abawl bangun, na masang uah pengkul mut sih un. Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, amaun anuomman uh amu zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten mi kunga silpieh na pieh chiengun, na khut zietlam un abawl, na khut veilam un theisih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n na sil pieh khu aguh ahi thei ding hi; tualeh na Pa uh aguh a hing mu pa’n langtang tah in ahing din ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tualeh na thunget chieng un, milepchiete banga na bawllou ding uh ahi, amaun miten amu theina ding un, kikhopna innte leh kholaidung lamka thuomte bangah ding kawm in thunget aut sese uhi, chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, amaun anuomman uh amuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen na thunget chieng un na pindan sung gil uah lut unlen, na kot uh kha unlen mun simtham a um na Pa uh kungah thungen un, tuachi’n aguh a hing mu na Pa un langtangtah in nou ahing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hinanleh na thunget chieng un Jentelte bangin thuginalou gen sawn sawn sih un, amauten agen tam zieh ua zah a um dingin akingaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin amauh bang sih un, aziehpen na nget masang un, na Pa un na tasapte uh atheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin tambangin thum un: Ka Pa uh van a um, Namin kizatat hen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na gam hing tung hen, na deilam van a akibawl bangin, lei ah zong kibawl hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni’n nichin a ka neh ding uh ann hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka leibate uh ka ngaidam bang un, ka batte uh hing ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solna ah hing puilut sinlen, gilou lah ah hing hunkhe zawin, gamte, silbawltheinate, leh thupinate kumtawn a Nanga ahizieh in, Amen! chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite atatkhelnate uh na ngaidam u’leh, na Pa uh van a um in zong noute ahing ngaidam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh mite tatkhelnate na ngaidam sih uleh na Pa un zong na tatkhelnate uh ahing ngaidam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuachiengleh ann na ngawl chiengun milepchiete bangin ngui mel posih un, amaun mite mitmu a anngawl uh akilat theina ding un, amaisuo uh atuom sah leng uhi. Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, amaun anuomman uh amuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten ann na ngawl chiengun na lutang uh sathau nu unlen, na mai uh phiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n mun simthama um na Pa uh muna loungal, mihingte mitmu a, anngawl na bahlouna ding un, tualeh na Pa uh aguh a hing mupa’n langtang tahin kipahman ahing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Lei a nget leh sam eeh in anehsiet na ah leh gutaten aphevang ua aguh theina uah gou kikhol sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh van ah, nget leh sam eeh in anehsiet louna leh, gutaten aphevang ua, aguh louna uah gou kikholzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen na gou uh umna mun ah, na lungtang u’zong a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tahsapumpi meivah khu mit ahi, tuaziehin na mit ahoi leh na tahsapumpi vahin adim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh na mit asiet leh na tahsapumpi amiel sieng ding hi. Tuaziehin na sunga vah khu miel hita leh tua mielna khu nasa va-ia va e izaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Koiman houtu ni nna asemkop thei sih, aziehpen khat amuda ding a, khat pen ait dinga, ahisihleh khat humin, khatpen asimmaw kha ding hi. Pasian leh sum nna nasemkop thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ka hing hil ahi, Bang ahiei ka neh ding, bang ahiei ka dawn ding, ahisihleh na tahsa ua dinga bang ahiei ka sil a ka ten ding chi’n na tahsa ua dingin lunghimaw sih un, neh ding sangin hinna athupizaw sih amah? Silleten sangin tahsa a thupi zaw sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tungleeng vate en un, bu atu sih ua, at zong a at sih uh, tualeh bu inn ah zong asunglut sih uh, ahivangin na Pa uh van a umin amauh ava hi; Noute amauh sanga nahpitah a thupizaw hilou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Noute lah a koi ahiei lunggim zieh a, adung lam tong khat a susang tuon thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n bang ding a sil leh ten thu a lunggim na hi uoi? Gamlah a lili pahte khan dan hoitahin ngaituo un, nna asemgim sih ua, mui zong azom ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh, ka hing hil ahi, Solomon ngelzong athupina zousie toh akizep vangin, tam lili pahte khat bangin akizem zou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamlah loupa tuni banga hing a, azingni chieng a thuhkhuh sung a pailut ding bawn Pasian in ahichi zep leh Aw nou ginna tawmte Aman noute tuasangin nihten puonsil in ahing zemzaw tham sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuazieh in bang ahiei ineh ding? Bang ahiei idawn ding? bang ahiei isil ding? Chi’n lunghimaw sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aziehpen tam silte zousie Jentelten asui uhi; tam silte na tasam uh chi na Pa uh van a um in athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian Gam leh adihtatna sui masa un, tuachi’n tam silte zousie piehbe na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tuaziehin zing chienga dingin lunggim sih un, aziehpen zingin ama a ding silte akilunggimpi na ding hi. Ni khat gimthuoh khu ni khat a dingin ahun ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Midang tung thu khen sih un, na tungthu uh khen a a umlouna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen na khenpieh mabang un noute zong ahing kikhenpieh ding hi, tualeh na tena mama un ahing kitepieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangdinga nangma mit a singtun um ngaituo loua na unaupa mit a nin neng neunou mu thei na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahisihleh bangchidan a na unau kunga, na mit a ninneng neunou khu hing lahdoh pieh vang na chi thei ding ahiei? En in, nangma mit ah singtun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang milepchie, nangma mit akipat in singtun khu ladoh masa in, tuachi’n na unau mit a ninneng neunou lahdoh ding khu kichientahin na mu thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Uite kungah sil siengthou pe sih un, ahisihleh voh masang ah na suongmantam uh pai sih un akeng un atuonchil ding ua, tualeh hing kihei in nangma ahing balnen kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ngen un, pieh in na um ding uh, sui un na mu ding uh, kiu un honpiehin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen a ngen pouma piehin a um ua, Koipou a sui in amu ua, koipou akiu pouma hon pieh in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahisihleh na lah uah, koi ahiei atapain tanghou ngen taleh suong pe ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahisihleh nga ngen taleh koi ahiei gul pe ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi ahileh, nou migilouin bawn na tate uh sil hoi piehna dan na thei uleh, na Pa uh van a umin akunga ngente sil hoi petham lou ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin sil zousie miten na tung ua abawl dinga na dei pouma uh, nouten zong mite tungah bawl un, tua khu dan thu leh guolneite thu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kot kochih ah lut un, manthaina lampi kot khu alien a, alampi zong agol hi, tualeh khuna lutte khu tam zong atam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinna zotna kot khu akochih a, alampi zong ahamsa a, amute zong atawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Guolnei dihloute lah ah pilvang un, amaute khu belam vun sil in na kung uah ahing pei leng ua, asunglam uah lah ngia gongsan ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaute aga uah na thei pai ding uhi, mi’n khaulingnei gui ah grep ga alou ngai uh amah? Ahisihleh theimiling kung ah theipi alou ngai uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachimabangin sing hoi pouma aga ahoi a, hinanleh sing siein ga hoilou asuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sing hoi aga ase thei sih a, sing sie zong aga ahoi thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sing chin ga hoilou pouma aphua ua, mei ah apai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute aga un na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mangpa, Mangpa hing chi zousie, vangam alut sih ding uhi, hinanleh ka Pa van a um deilam bawlte bou khu alut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin mi tampiin, Mangpa, Mangpa na min in thumavang ka gen ua, na min in dawite ka deldoh un, na min in sil lamdang tampi ka bawl uh hilou amah? Achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin ken akung uah noute ka hing thei ngai sih hi; nou silgilou bawlte aw, ka kung akipat in peimang un, ka chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tuaziehin mi koipou tam ka thugente za a, zui pouma mipil suongpi tunga inn lam mi toh ka gente ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Guo ahing zu a, tui ahing khang a, huipi ahing langa, tuo inn khu ahing mut vapual a, hinanleh apua sih hi, suongpi tung a lamdet ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh michin tam ka thugente za a, zuilou pouma khu, mimo senel tunga innlam mi toh ka gente ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Guo ahing zu a, tui ahing lien a, huipi ahing laang a, tua inn ahing mut vapual a, apuata hi, tua inn khu apua nasetah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Jesu’n tam thute agen zou in mipi’n athuhilte lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama’n laigiel mite banglou a, thu neina nei bang tahin amauh thu ahil hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh muolvum akipat a ahing peisuh laiin mipi thupitahin Ama azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh En vawi, miphah khat akungah ahing pei a Ama abie a, “Mangpa na ut leh na hing siengthousah thei hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akhut in azam a, akhoi a, “Ka ut hi, siengthoutain” achi hi. Tuachi’n aphah khu asiengthou pai lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n akungah, “Koima na hillou ding ahi, hinanleh pei inlen, siempu kungah va kilah inlen, Mosi in silpieh pieh dinga, athupiehte va pie in, atheichetna ding un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu Kapernaum khuo a alut in, akungah galkap zahoutu khat ahing pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mangpa ka suohpa zengin inn ah alum a, nasatah a sunatin a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Hing pei vangin sudam na vang,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Galkap zahoutuin a dawnga, “Mangpa ka innsunga na hing lutnataah ka hi sih hi, thu tengkhat genlachin ka suohpa adamta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen kei zong thuneina nuoi a um ka hia, ka nuoi ah galkapte a um ua, tualeh khat kungah pei in ka chileh apei a, tualeh adang khat kungah hing peiin, ka chileh ahing pei hi; tualeh ka suohpa kungah tami bawlin ka chileh abawl zel hi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu’n tam thu azah tahin lamdang asa a, Ama zuite kungah, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, Israelte lah ah zong tambang va-ia a ginna thupi ka mukha ngai sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ka hing hil ahi, suolam leh tumlam akipat in mi tampi ahing pei ding ua, van gam ah Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob toh atoukhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh gam tate pen pulam miel ah paidoh in aum ding uhi. Khunah kaa leh hagawtna a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n galkap zahoutu kungah, “Peita in na gintatna bangin nanga dingin bawl hita heh,” achi hi. Tuachi’n tuami dahkal mamain asuohpa adamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu Peter inn sunga alut tahin, Peter sungnu khosih a lum amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Ama’n amanu khut atham a, tuachi’n akhosih abeita hi. Tuachi’n amanu athou a ana uh aseppiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nitahlam ahing hi tahin, akungah dawimat tampi ahing pui ua, Ama’n thu in dawite adeldoh a, damlou zousie asudamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Guolnei Isai in, “Ama ngel in ihatlounate ala a, inatnate a pota hi.” Chi a agen khu ahing tangtun theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n akimvel a mihon thupitah amu tahin, gal langkhat a pei dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n laigiel mi koi ahiei khat a hing pei a, akung ah, “Siepa na peina tengah hing zui vang,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu’n akung ah, “Si-alten kuo anei ua, tungleeng vate’n bu anei uhi, hinanleh Mihing Tapa in vang alu ngahna ding mun anei sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh anua zuite lah a mi dang khat in akungah, “Mangpa va pei vangin ka pa vavui masa tavang” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n akungah, “Hing zuiin mishi in a mishi uh kivui uheh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh kuong sunga atuon tahin, anuazuite’n Ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh thakhat in khopihui thupitah ahing laang a, tua tui kihawt in kuong ahing tumta a, hinanleh Ama pen a imu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuazuite akung ah, ahing pei ua, ama aphong ua, “Mangpa hing hundam in, mangthang ding hitalou ka hi uoi mah!” Achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman akung uah, “Aw nou ginna tawmte bangding a zau na hi uoi mah?” achi a, Tuachi’n athou a, huipi leh tuipi aphawha, ahing dai dide ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten lamdang asa mama ua, “Tam mipa bang chibang mi ahiei? Khopihui leh tuipi nangawn in, athu aman uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh gal langkhat lam Gadara mite gam ahing tun tahin, dawimat mi ni, han a kipat a hing pawtin akituohpi ua, agiinhuoi mama zieh un, tuomi lampi ah koima apei ngamsih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh amaute thakhat in ahing kikoukhie ua, Jesu, “Nang Pasian Tapa, kou bang hing law ding na hiei mah? Ahun tun masanga koute sugenthei ding a hing pei na hiei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh a umna ua kipata gamla sim tah ah voh hon tampi ata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n dawiten “Na hing nawdoh a ahileh, voh honte sunga lut ding hing phalpieh in” chi’n Ama angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Pei un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n amauh ahing pawtdoh ua, vohhon sungah alut ua, thakhat in voh honte khu kawl ah ataikhe suh ua, tuipi ah atai lut ua, tui lah ah ashi gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n voh chingte atai ua, khopi sung ah alut ua, sil tung zousie leh dawimat mi nite tunga sil tungte abawn in ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />En vawi, khopi mite zousie Jesu kimupi dingin ahing pawt ua, tualeh Ama amu tah un, agam ua pat pawtdoh dingin hatang nget in angenta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama kuong sung ah alut a, agalkai a, Ama khopi ah ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh En vawi, mi khat zeng a damlou lupna a lum in akung ah ahing zawng ua, tuachi’n Jesu’n aginna uh amu tahin, zenga damloupa kungah, “Tapa lungmuong tahin um in, na khelnate, ngaidam ahita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ngai vawi, lai gielmi koite ahiei in, “Tam mipa’n Pasian agensie hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n angaituote uh athei a, “Bangding a na lungsim ua silgilou ngaituo na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na khelnate ngaidam ahita, chi leh, thou inlen na kengin pei in, chi koi abailamzaw diei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Mihing Tapa’n leitung ah khelnate ngaidam theina anei chi na theina ding un, (zeng a damloupa kungah) thou inlen, nalupna la inlen na inn ah peita’n,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amapa athou a, a inn ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua khu mipiten amu tah un, lamdang asa ua, tuabang bawltheina mihingte kunga pepa Pasian apahtawita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuana kipat in Jesu a pei zel a, sie piehna mun a tou, mi khat amin Mathiu kichi amu a; akungah “Hing zuiin,” achia, tuachi’n amapa adingdoh a Ama azuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Jesu ann ne dinga inn sunga atou lai in, En vawi, siekhon mite leh mikhielte tampi ahing pei ua, Ama leh anuazuite toh annkuong a imkhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuakhu Pharisaiten amu tahun, anuazuite kungah “Bangdinga na siepa un siekhon mite leh mikhielte toh ann aneh khawm ahiei?” Achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n tuakhu azah tahin akung uah, “Mi damtheiten daktorpa akiphamaw sih ua, mi chinaten bou akiphamaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh pei unlen, kithoina deilouin, hepina ka lunggul hi, chi umdan va zil un, aziehpen midihtatte han dinga hing pei kahisih a, mikhielte kisiasah dinga han a hing pei ka hizaw hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Johan nuazuite akungah ahing pei ua, “Bangding a kou leh Pharisaiten ann ngawl zel unga, na nuazuiten ngawllou ahi uoi?” Achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n akung uah, “Mouneipa akung ua a um laisie moupuiten asuun thei ding uh amah? Hinanleh mouneipa alah ua kipata lahmang ni ahing tung ding a tua hun chiengin ann angawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Koiman puon lui puontha them in aphaw ngaisih uhi, aziehpen aphawna in puon aluoikehzaw dinga, ahing keh semsemzaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahisihleh koiman zu tha savun thawl lui ah athun ngai sih uhi, tuachilouin vang savun thawlte apohkeh dinga, zu khu akibo ding a savun thawl zong asegawp ding hi; tuaziehin zu tha khu savun thawl tha ah athunzaw ua, tuachi’n ani in abit tuohtuoh hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman tam thute akung ua agen laiin, En vawi, vaihawmpa khat akung ah ahing pei a, Ama abie a, “Ka tanu tu mama in ashita hi, hinanleh hing pei inlen atung ah na khut koilachin ahing mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu adingdoh a, ama azuita a, tualeh anuazuiten zong a zuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh thakhat in numei khat kum sawm leh kum ni sipawt a damlou, anua ah ahing pei a, apuon mong akhoi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amanu’n alungsim in, “Apuon mong khoi leng zong ka dam mai ding hi,” chiin angaituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu akinuohei a, amanu amutahin, “Tanu lungmuong tahin um in na ginna in ahing damsahta hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n numeinu khu tuami dahkal akipat in adamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu vaihawmpa inn sunga alut tahin, theile tumte leh mipi kapleh mau vengvung ava mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aman akung uah “Mun awng sah un, naupangnu ashi sih hi,” a imu ahi bou hi achi hi. Tualeh amaun anuisan giap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh mipite apulam a asawldoh nua in, alut a, amanu akhutin atu a, tuachi’n naupangnu ahing thouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam thu khu tuo gam pumpi ah athang suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesu khuna kipat a apawtdoh tahin, mitto ni in azui ua, “David tapa ka tung uah zangai in,” chiin akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh inn sunga alut tahin mitto tegel akung ah ahing pei ua, tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Tami bawlthei dingin na hing gingta uh amah?” achi hi. Amaun akungah “Gingta e, Mangpa,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman a mit uh akhoi pieh a, “Na gintat bang un na tung uah tungta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh amit uh ahing vahta hi. Tualeh Jesu’n “Koima theisah lou dingin khautah in thu apie hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute gel apawtdoh tah un, tua gam pumpi ah Ama tungtang thu agen thang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amaute gel apawtdoh tahun, En vawi, mi hamtheilou dawimat khat akungah ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh dawi khu anawdoh tahin, hamtheilou khu ahing hamta hi, tuachi’n mipiten lamdang asa mama ua, “Israel gam ah tambang akimu ngai sih hi” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh “Pharisaiten dawimangpa zieha dawite anawdoh ahi,” achita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akikhopna innte uah thu hil in, leenggam khantanhoi thu genin, damlouna chinteng leh natna chinteng damsah in, khopi leh khoneute zousie tuon in avah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aman mipite amu tahin chingding neilou belamte banga gimthuoh leh kithethanga aumzieh un alainatta mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman anuazuite kungah, “Adihtahin bu lah ding atam mama a, hinanleh a nasem mite atawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaziehin bu la dinga nasemte hing sawl dingin bu neipa kung ah ngen un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Aman anuazui sawm leh nite ahat zou in, akung uah dawibuate nawdoh theina leh damlouna chinteng leh natna chinteng damsah theina thuneina apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sawltah sawm leh nite min khu tamte ahi: Amasa pen in Simon, Peter kichipa leh a sanggampa Andru; Zebedi tapa Jakob leh asanggampa Johan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philip leh Bartholomai; Thomas leh siekhonpa Mathiu; Alphai tapa Jakob leh Lebbai amintah Thaddeus;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kanaan mi Simon leh amansahpa Judas Iskariotte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawm leh nite khu Jesu’n asawldoh a, amaute thu apie a, “Jentelte lampi ah pei sih unlen, Samarite khopi sung ah zong lut vawt sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahivang in Israel innkuon belam mangte kung ah peizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh na pei kawm un, vangam anaita chiin gen zel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Damloute sudam unlen, phahte siengthousah unlen, mishite kaithou unlen, dawite notdoh un, amanbeiin na mu ua, amanbei main pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na sum ip sung uah, sana, dangka leh sum-eng guong sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khuolzinna uah thungpi ahiei, puonah ni ahiei, kengdap ahiei, ahisihleh chiengkhut ahiei, keng sih un, aziehpen nasem mi khu neh mutah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh khopi ahiei, khoneu ahiei, na lutna pou uah, na tunna ding taah uh mi kandoh unlen, na pawtdoh masangsie uh khunah tung khinkhian un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Innsunga na lut chiengun chibai buh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Innsunga mite chibai buh taah ahi u’leh na tung ah hamuonna hing tung heh. Hinanleh atah sih uleh, na hamuonna uh na kung uah hing kilekia heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh koipou nou hing kipahpi lou a, na thute uh angai nuom sih uleh, tua inn ahiei akipat ahisihleh tuomi khuo ahiei akipat na pawtdoh chiengun, na kengphang ua leivui thingkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, thukhen ni chiengin, tua khopi thuoh ding sangin, Sodom leh Gomorrah gam thuoh ding khu adan aum zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngai un, ngiete lah a belam bangin ka hing sawl ahi; tuaziehin gul bangin pil unlen, vakhu banga poikhoi louin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh mite lah ah kiveng un, aziehpen amaun vaihawmte ahing mansah ding ua, akikhopna innte uah noute ahing zep sah kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Keima ziehin, gam uhpipate leh leengte masangah, amauleh Jentelte theipimi hi dingin ahing pui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh ahing matsah chieng un, bangchi ding a, bang gen ding ka diei chiin lunggim sih un, na gen ding uh ahuntah a hing kihil ding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Agenpa nouma na hisih ding ua, na Pa uh Hagau in nouma ah genzaw ding ahi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh asang gampan thalup dingin asanggampa amansah ding a, tualeh pain zong atate, aman sah ding; tualeh tate’n zong nulepate adou ding ua, athatlum sah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka min ziehin mi zousie muda na hi ding uh, hinanleh atawp dong a thuoh zou pouma hundam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tam khopi sunga nou ahing suhgenthei chiengun, khopi dangah tailut un. Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, Mihing Tapa hing pei masangin, Israel khopi zousie na tuonsuoh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nuazui khat asiepa tungah a um ngai sih a, ahisihleh suoh khat apu tungah a um ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nuazui khat asiepa banga ahing um leh suohpa zong a pupa um banga aum khu ahunbep ahi. Amaun inntehpa bawn Beelzebub achi uleh a innkuonpite uh achi tham valeh masih ding uoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tuaziehin amauh giing sih un. Aziehpen langlou dinga ki phuol bangma um sih a, theilou dinga im zong bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Miel lah a nou ka hing hil pouma, khovah ah gen unlen, na bil ua na zahte uh inntungvum ah kitangkoupi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh tahsa that thei a Hagau that theiloute giing sih un, hinanleh Hagau leh tahsa ani a gawtmun a sumang theipa Ama khu giing zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vatou ni paisasan khat in akizua zel asiei mah? Ahivang in alah ua khat zong na Pa uh theilouin tuol ah akesih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na lutung ua na samzamte zousie uh nangawn sim sieng ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin zau sih un, vatou tampi sangin na manphazaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Koipou mite masang a hing hum pouma, ken zong van a ka pa mai ah, ama ka hum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh koipou mite mai a, kei hing kilepsan pouma Ken zong van a ka Pa masang ah ka kilepsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Leitunga lemna leengsah dinga hing peiin hing ngaisut sih un, lemna leengsah dinga hing pei ka hi sih a, namsau leengsah dinga hing pei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi apa dousah dinga, tanuin anu dousah ding leh mouin a innpinu dousah ding a hing pei ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh mi amelma khu ama innkuonpite mama ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Koipou apa ahiei, anu ahiei, kei sang a itzaw pouma ka mi hitah ahi sih; tualeh atapa ahiei, atanu ahiei, kei sang a it zaw khu ka mi hitah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh koipou a kros pua a hing zui lou khu ka mi hitah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Koipou ahinna muin ataan dinga, keima zieh a ahinna taan pouma in amu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Koipou noute hing kipahpi khu, Kei hing kipahpi ahi a, tualeh koipou kei hing kipahpi khu, Kei hing sawlpa kipahpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Koipou guolnei khu, guolnei ahizieh a kipahpi in guolnei kipahman amu ding hi. Tualeh koipou mi dihtat ahi zieh a kipahpi in midihtat kipahman amu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh koipou tam mi neute lah a khat nuazui ahi zieha tuisih nou khat maimai pie zong, chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, akipahman uh ataan vawt sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahi a, Jesu’n anuazui sawm leh nite thu apieh zou tahin, khuna kipat in khuote a thuhil ding leh thugen dingin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Johan in suongkul sung a pat a Khrist nasepte ana zahtahin anuazuite ni asawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akungah “Ahing pei dingpa na hiei mah, ahisihleh adangkhat ngah nalai ding ka hi uoi mah?” ava chi sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Pei unlen, na sil zahte u’leh na mute uh Johan va hil un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mittote mit in khuo amu theita ua, Kengbaite avah theita ua, phahte ahing siengthouta ua, bilbingte’n khuo aza theita ua, mishite kaithouin aumta ua, tualeh mizawngten zong khantanhoi kigen azata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh koupou ka tung a lunghimawna mu lou khu a hampha ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amauh apei tahun Jesu’n mipite kungah Johan tungtang agen panta a, “Bang en dinga gamdai a vapeita na hi uoi? Pumpeng hui sem ling ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahisihleh bang en ding a pawtdoh na hi uoi? puonnem sil mi khat i? Ngai un, puonnem silte khu leengpa innpi sungah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahisihleh bang en ding a pei doh na hi uoi? guolnei en dingin i? Ahi, ka hing hil ahi, guolnei sanga zong thupizaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En vawi, ka thangkou na masang ah ka sawl a, Aman na masang ah na lampi asiel ding hi, chi a atanchin kigielpa khu ama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, numei sunga pieng lah ah Baptispa Johan sanga thupizaw apieng kha nai sih hi, ahivangin van gama mi neupen zong ama sangin athupi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Baptispa Johan um akipat tutan dongin van gam in thagum a kinawhna athuoh leng hi, tualeh thagum a nawhten apawng lah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen zawlneite zousie leh dan thuin Johan hing um tandongin ana genlawhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh nouten na pom nuom u’leh, ama khu ahing pei dingpa Elijah ma khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Koipou zahna ding bil nei pouma in za heh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hinanleh tulai khangthate bang toh ka gente diei? Naupang vanzuona mun lah a tou a, alawmte uh han a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theile hing tumpieh unga, na lam sih ua, noute hing kaapi ung a na hing dapi sih uhi; chite bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Johan ahing pei a, ane in a dawn sih a, dawilawm nei ahi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing tapa ahing pei a, ane in a dawn a, En vawi uo, ann haipa, zu haipa, siekhonte leh mikhielte lawmpa,” achi uhi. Hinanleh pilna khu anasepten siem atangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n akisialou zieh un a sil thupi bawl tamna pen khopite aphawhta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Korazin na tung agih hi! Bethsaida na tung agih hi! Aziehpen noute lah a sil thupi kibawlte Tai-ar leh Sidon khopite a kibawl hitaleh, sai ip puon sil a, vut lah a kibuol in sawtlaipi in akisiata ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing hil ahi, thukhen ni chiengin noute thuoh ding sangin Tai-ar leh Sidon khopite thuoh ding khu, adan aum zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh nang Kapernaum, van tana tawisanga um ding kisa na hiei? Mishi khuo tandonga puisuh a um ding na hi, aziehpen na sunga sil lamdang thupi kibawlte Sodom khuo a kibawl hileh tutan dongin a um nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing hil ahi, thukhen ni chienga noute thuoh ding sangin Sodom khuo in a thuoh ding khu adan aum zaw ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin Jesu’n adawnga, “Aw, Pa van leh leitung Mangpa, nang mipil leh misiemte kungah tam thute na im a, naupangte kunga na phuon ziehin ka hing phat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi, Pa tuabang bawl khu nangma ngaiin ahoi ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka Pa’n sil zousie ka kungah ahing kemsahta hi, Pa louin Koima’n Tapa athei sih uhi, Tapa leh akung ua a theisah ding, Tapa in akunga aphuon utnate chilou ngal in koima’n Pa athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nou semgim leh puohgih pote zousie ka kungah hing pei un, Keima’n khawldamna ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka hahkol puo unlen, ka kungah zil un, aziehpen kei khu zainemtah leh lungtanga kingaingiemtah ka hi; tuachi’n na hagau ua dingin khawldamna na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen ka hahkol a nuoma, ka puoh zong a zang hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hunlaiin Jesu khu Khawlni in bulei lai kantan in apei a, anuazuite agil uh akiel a, buvuite asihtan ua, ane panta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua khu Pharisaiten amu tah un akungah, “En vawi, na nuazuiten khawlni a bawl sienglou abawl uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “David in agilkiel lai a alawmte toh bang ahiei abawl uh simkhalou na hi uoi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangchidan a Pasian inn a aluta ama leh alawmten neh sienglou siempute maimai neh thei tanghou siengthou aneh uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahisihleh Khawlni a Pasian biehinn a siempute’n khawlni asuhbua un zong siemtanlou in a um tuon sih chi dan thu simkhalou na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tam mun ah Pasian biehinn sang a thupi zaw khat a um hi chi ka hing hil ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivang in nouten kithoina hilou in zangaina ka dei hi, chi umdan na theita hi u’lachin mawna neilou khu siemlou tangsah lou ding hi ve u’chin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing tapa khu khawlni Mangpa ahiziehin achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuana kipat in apei a, akikhopna inn uah aluta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai vawi, khunah mi khat khutzaw a um a, tualeh amawpai theina ding un, amaun “Khawlni a mi suhdam asieng ei? chiin Ama adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Na lah ua koi ahiei khat in belam khat nei henlen, khawlniin kokhuh ah keta leh koi ahiei vatu-a kaidoh lou ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Belam khat sanga mihing khat bang chituh a manpha zaw ahiei? Tuaziehin khawlni a nahoisep asieng hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua mipa kungah “Na khut zahdoh in,” achi a, tuachi’n azahdoh a, alangkhat bangin ahing damta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharisaite apawtdoh ua, Ama thalup theina ding kikum in akihou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh tuakhu Jesu’n atheitahin khuna pat in akihemmangta hi; tualeh mipi tampi in Ama azui ua, Aman ana damsah sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Ama tanchin koima hillou dingin amauh thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua khu guolnei Isai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“En vawi, ka suoh ka tel, Ka deitah, ka lungdamna mama ahi; Ka Hagau atungah ka koi ding a, tualeh Aman Jentelte kungah, dihtah a vaihawmna thu agen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman akinielpi sih dinga, akikou sih ding hi, Koiman kholai dung ah, a aw aza sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dihtah a vaihawmna aguolzawsah, masangsiein pumpeng gawpsa, ahiehtawng sih dinga, meivah detna gui zong asumit sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Ama min in Jentelten kinepna anei ding uh, chi a agen ahing tangtun theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n dawimat, mitto leh hamtheilou khat Akungah ahing zawpi ua, Aman ana sudam a, tuachi’n mitto hamtheiloupa ahing ham thei a, amu theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh mipite zousiein lamdang asa ua, “Tam mipa David Tapa hilou amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Pharisaiten tam thu azah tahun, “Tam mipa’n dawimangpa Belzabub zieh loungal in dawite anotdoh sih ding,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n angaituonate uh athei a, akung uah, “Leenggam chinteng akilangkhen a amaleh ama akidou leh amangthai lenga, tualeh khopi chinteng ahisihleh innsung chinteng akilangkhen a akidou uleh ading zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Setan in setan mama notdohta leh ama leh ama kidou ahi dinga, bangchi’n aleenggam adingta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh ken Belzabub zieh a dawite notdoh ka hileh, na tate un koi zieh a anawdoh uh ahiei? Tuaziehin amaute khu noute tunga vaihawm mite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh Ken Pasian Hagau vanga dawite notdoh ka hi leh, Pasian gam na kung ua hing tung ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahisihleh mi’n mihat khu alepkaan masah sih leh bangchi’n a inn sunga lut in avante atommang pieh thei diei? Lepkaan masa in tua zou chiengin atommang pieh thei bep ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kei lam a panglou pouma kei hing dou ahi a, koipou ahing khopkhawmpi lou pouma in athethang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ka hing hil ahi, mite akhelna chinteng u’leh Pasian agensietna chinteng uah ngaidam ahi dinga, hinanleh Hagau gensietna hilhiel pen ngaidam ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Koipou Mihing Tapa kala thugen khu ngaidam ahi dinga, hinanleh Hagau Siengthou kalna a thugen pouma, akalna uh khu tu khang leh khang hing um ding ah zong ngaidam ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Sing khu ahoi a, aga zong ahoi hi na chi loungal uleh, sing khu asie a, aga zong asie hi, chi vanglah un; aziehpen sing khu aga in akithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gul suonte aw, na gitlouna pum ua bangchia sil hoigen thei ding na hi uoi? Aziehpen lungtang a dimlet kam in agen zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi hoiin alungtang goubawm hoi akipat in sil hoi ahing ladoh a, tualeh migilou in agoubawm hoilou akipat in sil hoilou ahing ladoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing hil ahi, miten thu ginalou agen pouma uh thukhen ni chiengin, azieh agen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na thuin siem tansahin na um ding a, na thu main siemlou tansah in na um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n laigielmite leh Pharisaite pawlkhat in adawng ua, “Siepa nang akipat in chiemtena ka mu nuom uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman adawng a, akung uah, “Khang gilou leh angkawm hatten chiemtena asui ua, hinanleh guolnei Jonah chiemtena loungal akung uah pieh ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonah sun thum leh zan thum ngapi gilsunga, a um mabangin, Mihing Tapa zong sun thum leh zan thum leigil sung ah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nineveh khuo a mite khu thukhenna ah tulai khangthate toh ading ding ua, a mawpai ding uhi, amaute Jonah thugen zieh in akisia pai ua, En vawi un, Jonah sanga thupizaw tanah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Simlam leengnu khu thukhen ni chiengin, tulai khangthate toh athou khawm ding ua, amawpai ding hi, Solomon pilna ngaikhe dingin bawn kawlmong apat ahing pei ngap hi, tualeh en un Solomon sanga thupi zaw tanah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Dawibua khu mipa akipat apawtdoh tahin, khawlna ding suiin tui um louna mun lah ah avah kawikawi a, amu zou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka pawtdohna inn ma ah lutkia mai vang achi hi. Tualeh ahing peikia tahin tua khu ana awnga, suhsiengsa leh kikem hoi in amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n ava pei a, ama sanga gilou zaw dawi dang sagi ahing zawpi a, khunah alut ua, atengta uhi; tuachi’n tua mipa umdan nukhia lam khu amasa sangin ase zaw semsemta hi. Tulai khangtha giloute tung ah zong tuabangin a um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mipite kunga thu agen lai in, En vawi, Anu leh asanggamten Ama houpi nuom in inn pulam ah Ama ngah in ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi khat in akung ah, “En vawi, na nu leh na sanggamte Nang hing houpi nuom in inn pulam ah ading uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman adawnga, Ama hilpa kungah, “Ka nu koi ahiei? Tualeh Ka sanggamte zong koite ahi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n a nuazuite lam ah akhut azah a, En un, “Tanah Ka nu leh ka sanggamte a um uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Koi hinanleh van a um ka Pa deilam bawl pouma Ka sanggampa, ka sanggamnu leh ka nu ahi uhi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni main Jesu khu inn apat in apeidoh a, tuipi pieu ah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh akungah mipi tampi ahing kikhawm ua, tuachi’n Ama kuong khat ah alut a, atouta hi, tualeh mipi zousie luipieu ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, gentenain thu tampi agen a, Ngai vawi un, “Buchithepa khat buchithe dingin akuon a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh athe laiin kimkhatte lamgei ah akie a, vate ahing pei ua, atom beita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kimkhatte suongsilei lah ah akie a, lei asalou ziehin ahing pou pai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh ni ahing suoh in a emvuoi a, thahui aneilou ziehin avuoi paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kimkhatte loulingnei lah ah a kie a, lingte ahing khang lien a, adepmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh adangte lei hoi ah akie a, Kimkhatte ale za bangin, kimkhatte ale sawmguh bangin, kimkhatte ale sawmthum bangin ahing gata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koipou zahna ding bil nei pouma in za heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuite ahing pei ua, akungah, “Bangdinga akung ua gentena thu nagen ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman adawnga akung uah, “Aziehpen vangam thuguh khu noute thei ding phal ahia, hinanleh amaute thei ding pen phal ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koipou aneite pieh be ahi dinga, ahau semsem ding, hinanleh koipou aneilou khu, anei sun zong lahpieh ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin akung uah gentena in thu ka gen ahi, aziehpen amauten mu napiin amu sih ua, tualeh za napiin aza sih ua, thei zong atheisiem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Isai in ana genlawh khu atung uah ahing tangtungta hi: Zahpen na za ding ua, na theisiem sih ding uhi; Mu pen na mu ding ua, na theichien but sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh tam mite lungtang amawlgawpta a, abil uh abingta a, a mitte uh asingta uhi, tuachilouin amit un amu kha ding ua, abil un aza kha ding ua, tualeh alungtang un athei kha ding ua, ahing kinuahei kia kha ding ua, Ken amauh ka na sudam kha ding hi, chi a ana gen khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh noute mit vang amu ziehin ahampha hi, na bil uh zong azah zieh in ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, guolnei tampi leh midihtat tampiin zong na sil mute uh mu aut ua, ahivangin amu sih uhi, tualeh na sil zahte uh zong aza nuom ua, hinanleh aza sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tuaziehin buchithepa gentena thu za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Koipouin leenggam thu azah a, atheisiem sih leh, migiloupa khat ahing pei a, alungtanga thesa khu alahmang pieh zel hi. Tua khu lam gei a thepa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suongsilei lah a kithete khu, thu za a, kipahtah a pom pai bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahivang in ama a thahui anei lou ziehin tomnou khat sung a um a; thu ziehin gimthuohna ahiei, gawtna ahiei, ahing um chiengin apua pai zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh loulingnei lah a the pen, thu khu za a hinanleh leitung awlmawnate leh hausatna solnain thu khu adep a, tuachi’n ama khu ga nei louin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh lei hoi tunga the pen, thu khu za a theisiem mi ahi; tua khu ga zong aga a, kimkhatte aleza bang, kimkhatte ale sawmguh bang, kimkhatte ale sawmthum bang in apung uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gentena dang akung uah agen kia a, “Van gam khu, mi alou a haichi hoi thepa toh gente ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh mite a imut kaal un amelmapa ahing pei a, bu lah ah bulem athe a, apeimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n bu khu ahing pou a, ahing vui a, tuachi’n bulemte zong ahing kilangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n inn neipa suohte ahing pei ua, akung ah, Pu na lou a chi hoi the hilou na hiei mah? bulemte hei akipat a hing um ahi uoi? achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aman akung uah, melma khat in abawl ahi, achi hi. Asuohten a kungah, ahileh koute va peiin tuate va lakhawm u’leeng hoi na sa ei? achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman hoisa lou e, bulemte na lahkhawmna lam uah, butahte zong na botkhawm kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bu lah dongin poukhawm u’heh, tualeh bu at hun chiengin, bu atte kungah, bulemte lakhawm masa phot unlen, mei a hal dingin alom lom in kaan un; hinanleh bute pen ka bupang sungah koilut un, ka china ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gente thu dang akung uah agenkia a, “Van gam khu ankam tang khat mi’n alaah a, alou a athe bang ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tua khu, haichi lah a neupen ahi a, hinanleh ahing khanlet chiengin, hampate sangin ahing lienzaw a, singkung ahing hita hi; tuachi’n tungleeng vate ahing pei ua, abazamte ah ahing gieh uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gentena dang khat akung uah agen kia a, “Vangam khu numei khat in tol alaah a, tangbuong tena thum lah a abawn a ajelsuoh masangsie a, aphum bang ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tam silte zousie Jesu’n gentena thuin mipite kungah agen a, gente thu louin akung uah bangma agen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Guolnei in, “Gentena in ka kam ka kaah ding a, Leitung siemchil a kipat sil aguh a, kiphuol khu ka gendoh ding hi, achi khu ahing tangtunna dingin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n mipite asawlmanga, innsungah alut a; tuachi’n nuazuite akungah ahing pei ua, “Lou a bulem gentena thu hing hilchien in” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aman adawnga, akung uah, “Tua haichi hoi thepa khu Mihing tapa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lou khu Leitung ahi, haichi hoite khu, leenggam tate ahi ua, tualeh bulemte khu migilou tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Melma athepa khu Diabol ahi a, bu lah hun khu leitung tawpna ding ahi, a atte khu vansawlsiengte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuazieh in bulemte khu akhopkhawm ua, mei a ahal bangun, leitung tawp hun chiengin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mihing Tapa in vansawlsiengte asawldoh ding a, aleenggam akipat in khelnabawlsahte leh silgilou bawl zousie akhawm khawm ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tualeh meilipi sungah apailut ding ua, khunah ka leh hagawtna a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin midihtatte khu a Pa uh gam ah, ni bangin ataang ding uhi. Koipou zahna ding bil neiin za heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Van gam khu lou lai a gou kiphuol bang ahi, tua khu mi khat in amu a, aphuoldap a, akipah ziehin, lungnuom tahin apei a, anei zousie azua a, tua lou khu aleita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Tualeh van gam khu summetbawl mi suongmanpha hoitah sui bang ahi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aman suongmanpha mantamtah khat amu a, apei a, anei zousie azua a aleita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Vangam khu lenpi tuipi a sepluta nga namkim huoikhawm bang ahi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua khu adimtahin pieugei ah akaikhie ua, atou ua, ahoite khu bawm sungah aguong ua, ahoiloute pen apaimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Leitung bei chiengin tuabangin a um ding hi. Vansawlsiengte ahing pawtdoh ding ua, migiloute khu midihtatte lah akipat akhenkhe ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Haltuina meilipi ah amaute apai ding uhi, khunah ka leh hagawtna a um ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Tam silte zousie na theisiem na uoi?” achi hi. Amaun akungah “Ing” Mangpa, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Tuaziehin laigielmi vangam thu a hil a um pouma khu, inn neipa agoubawm akipata sil lui leh sil tha pholdohpa bang ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Jesu’n tam gentena thute agen zouin, khuna pat in apeidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tualeh Ama a umna gam lam a ahing tun tahin, akikhopna inn uah amauh thu ahil a, tuachi’n amauten lamdang asa mama ua; “Tam mipa’n tambang pilna leh sil thupi bawltheina hei akipat a amu ahiei? achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tam Mipa, sing bawlsiempa tapa hi ngel lou amah? Anu Mari kichinu hilou ahiei mah? Tualeh asanggamte khu Jakob, Joseph, Simon, leh Judas hilou ahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tualeh asanggam numeite zong ikung ua um hilou uh i? Tua ahileh tam Mipa’n tam silte zousie hei akipata amu ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tuachi’n atungah, alunghimawta uhi. Hinanleh Jesu’n akung uah, “Guolnei ama gam sung leh ama inn sung loungal ah, pahtawi louin a um ngai sih hi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tualeh agintatlou zieh un, Aman khunah sil thupi tampi abawlta sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hunlai in leengpa Herod in Jesu thu kithang ana zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asuohte kungah, “Tam pen Baptispa Johan ahi ve, ama pen mishi lah akipat a thoudoh kia ata ve maw; tuaziehin silbawltheinate’n ama ah nna sem ahita ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Herod in asanggampa Philip zi Herodia zieh in Johan aman a, alepkaan a, suongkul ah akhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johan in akungah “Amanu na kitenpi asieng sih hi achi zieh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aman Johan that ut nanleh mipite agiing a, amaun Johan khu guolnei khat a angai zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Herod pien ni ahing tun in, Herodia tanu khu amasang uah alam a, Herod alungdamsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin amanu’n anget pouma pe dingin kihahsiel in thu achiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n anu thusawl in, “Baptispa Johan lutang kuong khat in tanah hing pie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa khu alunggimta a, hinanleh akihahsielna leh a annkuong impite ziehin, pieh ding in thu apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi asawl a, suongkul sunga um Johan lu ava tansahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh alutang khu kuongin ahing tawi ua, naupangnu apie ua, tualeh amanu’n anu kungah ahing tawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuazuite ahing pei ua, aluong ahing la ua, avui ua, tualeh Jesu ava hilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu’n tua thu azahtah in, khuna pat in, kuong a kitawlin gamgaw lam ah Amatangin apeita hi. Hinanleh mipiten azahtahun, khopite akipat in akeng ua peiin azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu ahing pei khiet leh mipi tampi a muta a, alainat sengseng a, adamloute uh asuhdampieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nitahlam ahing hitahin, anuazuite akungah ahing pei ua, “Tam mun gamgaw ahi a, tualeh ni lah avaigeita a, khuote a pei a aneh ding uh a lei theina dingun mipite sawldoh tain” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n akung uah, “Apeimang uh angai sih, nouman neh ding pie un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akung ah, “Tanah tanghou pheng nga leh nga ni beh i nei uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman tanah ka kungah “Hing tawi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite loupa tunga tou dingin thu apie a, tanghou pheng nga leh nga ni khu ala a, vanlam en in aguolzawl a, aphalsuo a, tanghoute khu anuazuite kungah apie a, tuachi’n nuazuiten mipite kungah ape sawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n abawn un ane ua, agilva chietta ua, anehval nengte uh akhopkhawm u’leh seu sawm leh ni adim nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anete khu numei leh naupang simlouin piching ngen tul nga vel ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu’n mipite asawlmang kaala Ama masanga na pei masa a, gal langkhat a na kai masa dingin; anuazuite kuongah kintah in atuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh mipite asawlmang zou tahin, Ama tanga thungen dingin muol ah akaltou hi. Tualeh nitahlam ahing hitah in, khunah amatangin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh kuong pen tuipi laikimtah ah a um a, huipi in ale nawh zieh in tuihuol in aseep kawikawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh zanlai khovah kuon lam in, Jesu amauh lam zuon in tuipi tungah akengin ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nuazuiten Ama tuipi tunga kenga hing pei amu tah un, “Shiha hiva” chiin abuoita ua, zauin akikouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh kintahin Jesu’n amauh ahing houpi a, “Lungmuongtahin um un, Keima ka hi, zau sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Peter in adawng a, “Mangpa Nangma ngel na hileh tui tunga nangma kunga hing pei dingin thu hing pie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Hing pei in” achi hi. Tuachi’n Peter kuong a pat in akumsuh a, Jesu kunga pei dingin tui tungah kengin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh huipi hattah amu tahin, azau a, tum dingin akisa a, “Mangpa hing hundam in” chiin akikouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n thakhat in a zam pai a aman, akungah “Nang ginna tawmpa, bang ding a ginglel na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh kuong sunga amauh atuontah un, huipi asipta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n kuong sunga umte’n “Nangpen Pasian Tapa tahtah na hina hi achi ua,” abeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gallang khat agalkai tahun, Gennesaret gam ahing tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khum muna miten Ama atheitah un, tua kim a gam chinteng ah mi asawl ua, damlou zousie akungah ahing pui ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tualeh apuon mong beh tham thei dingin angen ua, tuachi’n athamkha pouma adam zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem khuo a um laigielmite leh Pharisaite Jesu kungah ahing pei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bangdinga na nuazuite’n upate thugousie palsana takhiel zing uh ahiei? a ann neh ding chieng un akhut uh asil ngai sih uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman adawnga akung uah, “Bangzieh a nouten zong, na thugousie zieh ua, Pasian thupieh palsana takhiel na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian in na nu leh na pa zatat in, koipou anu ahiei a pa ahiei, gausap pouma shi sah ngeingei ding chi ahi thuoi a, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten koipou anu ahiei apa ahiei kunga, kei kunga kipat a phattuomna na mu ding pouma Pasian kunga pieh ahita, chi pouma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a nu leh apa azatat ding ahi sih na chi uhi. Tambangin, na thugousie zieh un, Pasian thupieh bangmalou na suohsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou milepchiete aw, Isai in na tungtang thu uh ana genlawh adih mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam miten akam un ahing nai ua, akam un ahing zatat uhi; Hinanleh alungtang un ahing gamlat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh athuhilna uah mihing thupieh akihil zieh un, Kei ahing bieh uh amawhna ahibou hi, ana chi khu,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman mipite ahan a, akung uah “Ngai unlen theisiem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kam a lut in asubua sih a, Kam apawtin, tuami ngei in mi asubua hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuazuite ahing pei ua, akungah, “Pharisaiten tam thu azah ua alungkimlou dan uh na thei ei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman adawnga akung uah, “Singkung chinteng, van a um ka Pa suonlou khu phungkal in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute awlmaw sih un, amaute khu mitto lamkaite ahi uh. Mittaw in mitto apui leh ani un kokhuh ah akekhawm ding uhi,” chi’n adawnghi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in adawnga akungah, “Tam gentena thu koute hing hilchien in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n, “Noute zong tutan dong theisiem lou a um nalai na ve uoh maw? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kam sunga lut zousie gilpi ah atungsuh a, dailenna ah paidoh in a um chi na theisiem nai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Kam a pawtte pen lungtanga kipat a hing pawt ahia, tuaten mi abuasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen lungtang akipat in ngaituona giloute, tuolthanate, angkawmnate, numei leh pasal kaal a mawnate, guhtatnate, theipitu dihlou a pannate leh mi gensietnate ahing piengdoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam silte khu ahi mihing buasah, hinanleh khut sil lou a ann neh in mi asubua sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuna kipat in Jesu apawtdoh a Tai-ar leh Sidon gam lam ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, tua gam akipat in Kanaan numei khat ahing pei a, “Aw Mangpa David Tapa Kei hing khotuo in, ka tanu dawimatin agim mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman kamteng khat in zong adawng sih hi. Tualeh anuazuite ahing pei ua, akungah, “Amanu sawlmangin, inua ah akikou kou mai hi,” chiin angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aman adawng a, Israel innkuonte lah a belam mangte kung loungal ah sawl ka hi sih, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu ahing pei a, “Mangpa hing panpi in chi’n Ama abeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman adawnga, “Tate tanghou lahpieh a, ui noute kunga pieh akilawm sih hi achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n, “Mangpa ahivang ahina hi, hinanleh uiten zong apu uh dawkan akipat a tanghou neng kete ane zel sam uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga, amanu kungah, “Numei aw, na ginna thupi hina va-ia e, na lunggul bang tahin na tungah umta heh,’” achi hi. Tuachi’n atanu khu tua hun mama in adamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu khuna pat in apei a Galili tuipi gei ah ahing tunga, tualeh muol ah apei tou a, khunah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi tampi, kengbaite, mittote, hamtheiloute, piengkhielte, leh natna dang neite hing pui in, Jesu kengbul ah alumsah ua, Aman ana sudam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachia hamtheiloute ahing ham ua, piengkhielte ahing hoi ua, kengbaite kenga hing peitheita, mittoten khuo amu theita uh, chi mipiten amu tah un, lamdang asata ua, tuachi’n Israelte Pasian apahtawita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n anuazuite akungah ahan a, mipite tuin ka kungah ni thum a umta ua, neh ding bangma aneilou zieh un, ka hepi mama hi. Tualeh amauh ann ngawl in ka peisah nuom sih hi, dachiengin lamkaal ah basam khava uh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuazuiten akungah, “Mipi hichiza a tam gilvana tham ching tanghou gamdai ah, hei apat imu diei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Tanghou pheng bangza na nei uoi? achi a; tuachi’n amaun, pheng sagi leh nga neu tawmnou khat, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman mipite tuol a tou dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh tanghou pheng sagi leh nga ala a, kipah thu agen a, aphal suo a, nuazuite kungah apie a, tualeh nuazuiten mipite kungah apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n abawn un ane ua agilva chietta uhi; tualeh aneh val neng uh akhop uleh seu sagi adim nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh anete pen numei leh naupang simlou in piching ngen tulli ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite asawlmang a, kuong sungah atuong a Magdala gam lam ah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharisaite leh Saddukaite ahing pei ua, Ama ze etna dingin van akipat chiemtena amauh ensah dingin angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman adawnga akung uah, “Nitahlam chiengin khuo apha ding hiva, mei san asuoh na chi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh zingmawng chiengin, Tuni khuo ase ding hiva, mei san a suoha angiemkai hi, na chi thei zel uhi. Nou milepchiete aw, van umdan na theisiem ua, hinanleh hun chiemtena na thei siem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khangtha gilou leh angkawm hatte’n chiemtena asui ua, hinanleh guolnei Jonah chiemtena loungal akung uah chiemtena dang pieh ahi sih ding, achi hi. Tualeh amauh anuasie a, apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh anuazuite gallang khat atun un, tanghou apo manghil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, Pharisaite leh Saddukaite tol lah ah kiveng unlen, pilvang un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh amaun “Tanghou ipuoh lou zieh ave maw,” chiin akingai sut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu’n tuakhu atheidoh tahin akung uah, “Nou ginna tawmte aw, tanghou na puohlou zieh ua bang ding a kingaituo na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu nangawn a na lungsim ua thei nailou na lailai na hi uoi mah? Mi tulnga, vahna tanghou pheng nga leh na seupi dimsah za uh, na thei zing sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tulli, vahna tanghou pheng sagi leh na seupi dim zat uzong?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tanghou thu na kung ua gen ka hi sih a, Pharisaite leh Saddukaite tol lah ah kiveng un, chia gen ka hizaw chi bang ding a theisiemlou na hi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabepin amaun tanghou tol lah a kiveng ding a thuhil hilou in, Pharisaite leh Saddukaite thuhilna lah ah pilvang dingin amauh athuhil ahizaw chi atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu Kaisaria Philippi gam ahing tun tahin Anuazuite Kungah, “Mite’n Kei Mihing Tapa khu koi ahi achi uoi?” chi’n adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun, “Kimkhat in Baptispa Johan ahi ahing chi ua, Kimkhat in Elijah ahi achi ua, tualeh adangten Jeremiah, ahisihleh guolneite lah a khat ahi, ahing chi uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Ahileh nouten kei koi ahi na hing chi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Simon Peter in adawng a, “Khrist Pasian hing Tapa khu na hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akungah, “Simon Bar-Jonah na hampha hi, tahsa leh sisan in ahing theisah na hi sih a, Ka Pa van a um in ahing theisah na hi zaw hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Ken zong na kungah, Nang Peter na hi, chi ka hing hil ahi, tualeh tami suongpi tungah ka hattuom ka lam dinga, mishi khuo kul kotkhaten tuami azouthaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ken vangam chabite nang ka hing pe dinga, leitunga na kaan pouma van ah zong kaan ahi dinga, tualeh leitunga na sutkhieh pouma van ah zong sutkhieh ahi ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama khu Jesu Khrist ahi chi koima hillou dingin anuazuite khautah in thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun akipat in Jesu’n Jerusalem ah apei dinga, upate, siempu liente, leh laigiel mite, lah a sil tampi athuoh dingte leh tha a a um dingdan leh, ni thum ni a athawkia ding dante, anuazuite atheisah panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in Ama apuituom a, Pasian in phalsih heh, “Mangpa! Tambang na tungah tung ngai sih heh,” chi’n aphawhhilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama akihei a, Peter kungah, “Setan ka nua ah pei in, Kei a dingin kipalpuana na hi, Pasian silte ngaituo louin, mihing silte na ngaituo zaw zieh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n anuazuite kungah, “Mi koipouin ahing zui ut leh ama gimthuoh khawhsa louin, a kros puo in hing zui heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Koipou ahinna humbit ut in ataan dinga, tualeh Koipou keima zieh a ahinna tan in amu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi khat in leitung pumpi nei henlen, ahinna taan taleh ama adingin bang aphatuom diei? Ahisihleh min ahinna taangin bang ahiei apieh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing Tapa khu vansawlsiengte toh a Pa thupina a kizemin ahing pei ding zieh in, tua hun chiengin michin anasep dungzui un nuomman ape chiet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hinghil ahi, Tana dingte lawikhat Mihing Tapa aleenggam a hing pei amu masangsie uh, shina chiem vawtlou ding a um uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh ni guh nua in Jesu’n Peter, Jakob leh asanggampa Johan atuom in muol sangtung khat ah azawpi touta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amasang uah amel ahing kiheng lamdangta hi. Amai ni bangin ahing taangta a, apuonsilte vah bangin ahing vamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh En vawi, Mosi leh Elijah akung ua hing kilah in Ama toh akihou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in Jesu ahoupi a, akungah, “Mangpa ei a dingin tana um ahoi hi, pha na sah leh tanah bawhinn thum bawl vai in, Nanga dingin khat, Mosi adingin khat tualeh Elijah ading in khat achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Agen lai zingin, En vawi, meilum vah tahin amauh ahing lieta a, tualeh Ngai vawi, thakhat in meilum lah akipat in aw khat in, “Tami ka Tapa ittah, ka lungdamna mama ahi. Ama thu ngai un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh nuazuite’n tami azahtah un bohkhup in apua ua, azau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu ahing pei a, amauh akhoi a “Thou unlen zau sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh adahdoh uleh, Jesu chilou koima amu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Muol a kipat ahing kumsuh un, Jesu’n amauh thu apie a, “Mihing Tapa mishi lah akipat a thawkia masangsie, tam na sil mu uh koima kungah hil sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tualeh Anuazuiten tua ahileh bang dinga laigielmiten Elijah hing pei masa ding achi uh ahiei?” Chiin adongta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Elijah hing pei masa ding mawng ahi, sil bangkim asiempha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing hil ahi, Elijah pen ahing pei zou thamta hi, ama athei sih ua, atung ah a ut ut un abawl zouta uhi. Tuamabangin Mihing Tapa in zong akhutlum uh athuoh ding hi, chiin adawng hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuiten Baptispa Johan thu akung uah agen ahi chi ahing theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh mipi lah ahing tuntah un, mi khat akungah ahing pei a, amasang a khupdin in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mangpa ka tapa hing khotuo piehin, shibup vei ahi a, agim thei mama hi, tam veipi mei ah apua lut a, tam veipi tui ah zong apua zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh na nuazuite kungah ka hing pui a asudam thei sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga, “Khangtha ginnabei leh chimawte aw, bangtan vei ahiei na kung ua ka um ding, ama khu ka kung ah hing pui un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n dawi aphawh a, asunga kipat in apawtta a, tualeh naupang khu tua huntahin adamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuazouin nuazuite akungah, atuom in ahing pei ua, “Bangdinga kouten notdoh theilou ka hi uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Na gintatlou zieh uh ahi, chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, ankam tang khat chie ginna na nei uleh, tami muol kung ah, Tana kipat in khunah kisuon in na chi ding ua, akisuon mai ding hi, tualeh nou a ding in bangma bawlmaw a um sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Bangtenghitaleh, tambang pen thumna leh anngawlna loungal in apawtdoh sih hi achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Galili gam a aum lai un, Jesu’n akung uah, “Mihing Tapa pen mihingte khuta matsahin a um ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tualeh Ama athat ding ua, tualeh ani thum ni in kaithouin a um ding,” achi hi. Tuachi’n alunggim mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kapernaum ahing tun tahun Pasian biehinn a sie dongte Peter kungah ahing pei ua, “Na siepa un biehinn sie pe zel samlou ahiei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman “Pie e,” achi hi. Tualeh peter inn sunga ava lut tahin, Jesu’n ama ahoupi masa a, “Simon nang bang nachi ngai ei? Leitunga leengten sie leh sum leiman koite lah akipat ala zel uoi? Atate u’lah ah ahiei, ahisihleh mi dangte lah ah?” chiin ana gen khal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Peter in akungah, “Mi dangte lah ah,” achi hi. Jesu’n akungah, “Tuachi ahileh tate awl a ve maw, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahivang in amaute lung himawhsah da vai, tuipi ah va pei inlen, ngakuoi va kam inlen, nga hing pei masa pen man inlen, akam keh lachin dangka khat na mu ding a, tuakhu la inlen Kei leh nang a dingin akung uah pie in, tuachilou in vang isulungkim sih kha ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitah in nuazuite Jesu kungah ahing pei ua, “Van gam ah koi alienpen diei?” Achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n naupang neu khat akungah ahan a, alah uah ading sah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, Na kikhel ua, naupang neute bang na hisih u’leh van gam ah na lut vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin koipou tam naupang neu banga kingaingiem mi khu, van gam ah alienpen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tualeh koipou ka min zieh a tambang naupang neu nou khat kipahpi khu, Keima hing kipahpi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tam Keima hing gingta neu noute lah a khat zong kipalpuasah pouma angawng uah bu hehna suongsum ki awsah henlen tuipi thutah ah kipailut leh ama a dingin ahoizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Puanate ziehin leitung atung agih hi, Puanate hing um ding mawng ahi a, hinanleh puana umsahpa tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khut ahiei ahisihleh na keng ahiei in ahing puasah leh sattan inlen paimangin, khut ni ahiei, keng ni ahiei nei a, kumtawn mei a pailut a um sangin khut langkhat bei leh kengbai a hinna a lut nanga dingin ahoizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh namit in ahing puasah leh kheikhie inlen, paimang in; mit ni nei a gawtmun mei a pailut a na um sangin, mit khat nei a hinna a lut nanga dingin ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tam mi neute lah a khat zong simmawlou dingin pilvang un, aziehpen avansawlsiengte un, van a um ka Pa maisuo a en zing uhi, chi ka hinghil ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing Tapa khu Mangthaite hundam dinga hing pei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang nachi ngaituo uoi? Mi khat in belam zakhat nei henlen, alah ua khat vahmang taleh, sawmkuo leh kuote nuasie in muol leh taangte a pei in, avahmang pen vasui lou ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh va mu kiata henlen hileh, chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, sawmkuo leh kuo vahmang loute tungah sangin, tua belam pen tungah akipah zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuamabangin tam mi neute lah a khat zong amanthai ding van a Ka Pa deilam ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuathamlouin na sanggam in na tunga sil abawlkhiel leh pei inlen nang leh ama beh thei in akhelna khu hil in, aman na thu asan leh na sanggampa na zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh asannop sihleh, theipi mi ni ahiei, thum ahiei, kama namdet ahi thei na dingin, mi khat ahiei, ni ahiei zawpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh amauh thugen zong asan nuom sih leh hattuomte kungah tutin, tualeh hattuomte thugen asan nuom nahlai sih leh, ama khu nanga dingin, ginglou leh siedong mi bang hi mai heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, leitunga na kaan pouma uh van a zong kaan ahi dinga, tualeh leitung a na sutkhieh pouma uh van ah zong sutkhiet ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Adihtahin ka hinghil kia ahi, leitunga mi ni asilnget tungtang ua akithutuoh u’leh ka Pa van a um bawlpieh in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen mi ni ahiei thum ahiei ka min a akikhop na phot uah, alah uah ka um zel ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter ahing pei a akungah, “Mangpa ka sanggam in bangzat vei ahiei ka tunga akhel leh ka ngaidam ding? Sagi vei tandong adiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Sagi vei dong ka hing chi sih a, sagi vei mun sawmsagi tandong ka chizaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuaziehin van gam khu leengpa koi ahiei in asuohte toh sum thu tuot a suhtup tum toh gente ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh asuhtup pat tahin, mi khat talent tul sawm ba akungah ahing pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh aman apieh zoulou ziehin, apu in ama leh azi atate toh, tualeh anei alam teng toh zua a dit ding thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin suohpa khu apu mai ah akhupboh a, Pu aw, ka tungah zangai tadi in, ka bat zousie hing sang sieng navang, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua suohpa khu apu in ahepita mama a, ahakhie a, abat angaidamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh tua suohpa khu apawtdoh a, asuoh hipite lah a khat, ama sum za khat bapa ava mu a, tualeh ama aman a, Na bat hing pie’n chi’n alawl mehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuoh hipipa akengbul ah akhupboh a, ka tungah zangai tadiin, hing sang sieng navang, chiin a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh a ut sih a, abat teng asan zou masangsie suongkul ah akhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuoh hipiten asilbawl dan amu tah un, alunggim mama ua, ahing pei ua, a sil bawl dan teng a Pu uh kungah ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuabep in a Puin ama ahan a, akungah, Nang suoh giloupa, na hing nget ngutngut zieh a na bat zousie hing ngaidam ing a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ken nang ka hing hepi banga, nang zong na suoh hipipa na hepi ding hilou amah achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh apu alungthahta a, abat zousie a san zou masangsiein, migawtte kungah apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Michin in na lungtang sunggil ua, na sanggamte uh na ngaidam sih u’leh ka Pa van a um in zong tuabangmain na tung uah abawl ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n tua thute agen zouin, Galili gam akipat in apawt a, Jordan lui gal Judia gam ah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipi tampi in Ama azui ua, Khunah Aman amaute ana sudam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pharisaite zong akungah ahing pei ua, “Ama aze et ua, akungah, bang ahiei zieh khat poupouin mi’n azi akhul a sieng ei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Aman adawnga, akung uah, “Achiil akipat a ama uh siempa’n numei leh pasal in ana siem hi, chi simkhalou na hi uoimah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tamte ziehin pasal in anu leh apa anuasie dinga azi atu ding hi, tuachi’n ani un sapumkhat ahing hita ding uhi, achi hi; chi na sim sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh ni ahi nawn sih ua, Sapumkhat ahita uhi. Tuaziehin Pasian in agawmsa mihingin khen sih heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun akungah, “Ahileh bangding a Mosi in kikhulna lai pieh a khul ding ahi, chia thu apieh ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Mosi in na lungtang uh akhau zieha, na zite uh khul ahing phalpieh ahi, hinanleh achiil akipat in tuachibang ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh ken ka hing hil ahi, Koipou in, angkawm zieh hiloupi a azi akhul midang akitenpi leh angkawm ahi, tualeh khulsa kitenpi pouma zong angkawm ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anuazuiten akungah, “Pasal azi toh kaal thu tuabang ahileh, zi neilou ahoizaw hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman akung uah, “Tam thu kigen pen mi zousie in apom thei sih uhi, akung ua pieh a umte loungal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Michilge khenkhat anu uh gilsung apat tuabang mawnga pieng a um ua, tualeh michilge mihing khuta gete zong a um ua, tualeh michilge, vangam zieh a, amau’leh amauh michilge a kibawl zong a um uhi. Koipou apom theiin pom uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n atung ua akhut koi a, athumpieh dingin akungah naupang neute ahing zawpi ua, hinanleh nuazuiten amauh ana phawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n “Naupangte ka kungah hing pei sah un, amauh khaam sih un, vangam khu tambang mite a ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh atung uah akhut akoi a, khuna kipat in apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En vawi, mi khat ahing pei a akungah, “Siepa hoi, kumtawn hinna ka nei theina dingin sil hoi bang ka bawl diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akungah, “Bangdinga mi hoi hing chi na hiei? Pasian chilou mi hoi dang a um sih hi; bangtenghileh hinna a na lut nuom leh thupiehte zui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman A kungah, “Abangpente ahiei?” achi a, Jesu’n akungah, “Tualthat sin, angkawm sin, guta sin, theipitu dihlou in pang sin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na nu leh na Pa zatat in, tualeh nangma na ki it banga na innvengte na it ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tangvalpan akungah, “Tamte zousie ka neulai apat ka zui zel hi, bang ka tasam nalai ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Hoibukim na ut leh, pei inlen na neisa zua inlen mi zawngte kungah pie in, tuachi’n van ah gou na nei ding hi; tualeh hing pei inlen Kei hing zui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh tangvalpa’n tua thu azahtah in lunggim tahin apei mangta hi; sum tampi nei ahi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n anuazuite kungah, “Adihtahin ka hinghil ahi, mi hausa adingin vangam lut ahasa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh ka hinghil kia ahi, mi hausa Pasian gam a alut sangin sangawngsau phinbil hawm a alut suoh abailam zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anuazuiten tami azah tahun lamdang asa mama ua, “Koi hundam in a um zou diei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n amauh a en a akung uah, “Tami mihing bawlthaw guol ahi sih a, hinanleh Pasian a dingin bangkim bawl thei ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in akungah, “Ngai vawi, kouten bangteng taisan in Nangma ka hing zuita uhi. Tuaziehin bang ahiei ka lawtah ding uh?” Chiin adongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Adihtahin ka hinghil ahi, sil zousie siemtha ahi chienga, Mihing Tapa avangletna toupha a atou chiengin, nou Kei hing zuite khu Israel nam sawm leh nite vaihawm in mangtoupha sawm leh ni tungah na tou sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh michin ka min zieh a innte ahiei, asanggampa ahiei asanggamnu ahiei, a pa ahiei, anu ahiei, azi ahiei atate ahiei, agamte ahiei, taisan pouma in aleza amu ding ua, kumtawn hinna atang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh mi tampi amasa pente anukhia ding ua, anukhiapente amasa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Vangam khu gamneipa khat agrep huon a nasem ding mi chiel ding a zingmawng matah a kuonkhie bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’n anasem dingte toh ni khat a makhai khat law dinga akithukim tahun, agrep huon ah asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama khu nai kuo ding vel in apawtdoh a, mi dangte van zuana muna mawh dinte amu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Akung uah, nou zong grep huon ah vakuon un, akilawm hun ka hing pen a ding hi, achi hi. Tuachi’n amau’zong akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh sunkim leh nitah lam nai thum ding velin ava pawtdoh kia a, tuabangmain ava bawl kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh nitahlam nai nga ding vel in ava pawtdoh kia a, midang ding maimaite amu a, aman akung uah, Bangdinga sunnitum a tana mawh din na hi uoi mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun akungah, Koiman ahing goi lou zieh in achi uhi. Aman akung uah noute zong grep huon ah va kuon un, akilawm bang zel na mu ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n nitahlam ahing hitahin, grep huon neipa’n asumkempa kungah, nasem mite han inlen, anukhia pen apat in amasa pen tan in alaw uh pie in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n nitahlam nai sawm leh khat ding vel in, ami goite uh ahing pei u’leh makhai khat chiet asang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akuon masate ahing pei un, mu tam deu dingin akingaituo ua, hinanleh amaun zong makhai khat chiet ma asang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh sum asan zou un, gam neipa tungah aphunta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam anukhia pente’n naikal khat sung beh na asem ua, kou nisa thuoh a khosa kai a, sun nitangtum a semgimte toh na hing kibangsah hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh aman alah ua mi khat adawng a, Lawm aw na tungah bangma ka bawlkhiel sih hi, makhai khat law dinga kihoutuoh hilou imah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma a kilah inlen peitain, tam anukhia pen kungah zong nang ka hing pieh bangin ka pe nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka neisa ka ut ut a ka bawlthei hinalou amah? Ka hoi zieh a thangsie na hiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuamabangin anukhia pente amasa pente ahing hi ding ua, amasapen te anukhiapente ahing hi ding uhi. Aziehpen chielte tampi ahi ua, telte tawmnou ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu’n Jerusalem khuo a apeitou lai in anuazui sawm leh nite Lampiah atuom in azawpi a akung uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ngai un, Jerusalem zuon a peitou ihi ua; Mihing Tapa khu Siempu liente leh laigiel mite khut ah matsah in a um dinga, tualeh amaun shi dingin amawpai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Ama khu chiemmui bawlna ding leh zep ding leh Kross a kilbeh dingin Jentelte khut ah ape ding uhi. Tualeh Ama ni thum niin athou kia ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zebedi tapate nu atapate toh Jesu kungah ahing pei ua, akhupboh a, Ama apat bang ahiei deisahna khat angen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman amanu kungah, “Bang ahiei na dei?” achi hi. Amanu’n akungah, “Tam ka tapate gel na leenggam ah khat na ziet langah khat na veilang a tou dingin deisahna pie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n adawnga, “Na nget khu na thei sih hi. Nouten ka nou dawn ding na dawn thei ding uoi? Tualeh ka baptisma tan ding na tang thei ding uoi?” achi hi. Amaun akung ah, “Thei e,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Ka dawn ding nou khu na dawn ngei ding ua, Ka baptisma tan ding zong na tang ngei ding uhi, hinanleh ka zietlam leh ka veilam a tousah ding thu pen Keima pieh ding ahisih a, ka Pa’n abawlpiehsate ading ahibou hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh sawmten tam thu azahtah un, sanggam nite gel tungah alungthahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n amaute akungah ahan a, “Jentel vaihawmte atung uah alien mama ua, tualeh milien milalten atung uah thu anei mama uhi, chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh noute lah ah tuabang ding ahisih hi, koihitaleh na lah ua let ding lunggul pouma, na nasem un pang phot heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh na lah ua, masapen hi nuom khu na suoh un pang phot heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihing Tapa nangawn zong naseppieh a um ding in ahing pei sih a, nna sem ding leh mi tampi tatna dinga ahinna pe dinga hing pei ahizaw hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeriko khuo apeisan tah un mipi tampiin Ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, mitto ni lamgei a touten Jesu lampi ah apei hi chi azah tahun, “Aw Mangpa David Tapa ka tung uah zangai in,” chi’n akikouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten sip dingin avau ua, hinanleh amaun, “Aw Mangpa David Tapa ka tung uah zangai in” chi’n akikou semsemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu ading denta a, amaute ahan a, “Na tung uah bang bawlleng na ut uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amaun akungah, “Mangpa mitvah ka ut uh” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n ahepi a, amit uh athampieh a, tualeh thakhat in amu thei pai ngal ua, tualeh Ama azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem atun kuon ua, Olive muol a Bethphage khuo atun un, Jesu’n anuazuite ni asawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Akung uah, na mazawn ua khuo ah “Va pei unlen, sabiltung kikhi akunga anou toh na mu pai ding uhi. Tuate sut unlen ka kungah hing kai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh mi koipouin na kung ua gen anei leh Mangpa’n ama uh atuulmaw hi, na chi ding uhi, tuachi’n aman ahing sawlpai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte zousie guolnei kam a kigensa ahing tangtun theina ding a hing um ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />En in, “Na leengpa kingaingiem tahin sabiltung tungah, sabiltung nou tung ngei a tuong in, na kungah ahing pei chiin, Zion tanu hil in” chi khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuite ava pei ua, Jesu’n akung ua thu apieh bangin abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun sabiltung leh anou ahing kai ua, atungah apuonte uh apha ua, atungah Jesu atousah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh mipi tamtah in, apuonte uh lampi ah apha ua, midangten singbawh asat ua lampi ah apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amasanga pei mipite leh anua a zuiten, David Tapa kungah “Hosanna, Mangpa min a hing pei khu ahampha hi, Tungnung pen ah Hosanna,” chiin akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem khosung a lut tahin, “Tam mipa koi ahiei?” chiin khopi sung pumpi akilingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten “Tam mipa guolnei Jesu, Galili gam a Nazareth khuo a mi ahi,” achita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu Pasian biehinn sungah alut a, biehinn a van zuate leh van leite zousie adeldoh a, tualeh sum heng mite dawkante leh vapal zuate touna haw akhule pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh akung uah, “Ka inn khu thu nget na inn akichi ding hi chi gel ahi, hinanleh nouten gutate munpi na suohsahta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh mittote leh kengbaite bieh inn sung ah akungah ahing pei ua, Aman ana damsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh siempu liente leh laigiel miten asil lamdang bawlte leh biehinn a, “David Tapa kungah Hosanna, chia naupang kikoute amu tah un,” alungthahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Akung ah, “Tamten bang ahiei agen uh naza ei?” achi uhi. Tualeh Jesu’n akung uah, “Kaza hi. Naungehte leh nawitep lai nausente kam a kipat in pahtawina abukim sahta, chi khu na simkha ngai sih uh amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute anuasie a, khopi apat in apawtdoh a, Bethani zuon in apei a, khunah agiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh zingmawng a, Khopi lam zuona ahing kilekia lam in agil akielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh lamgei ah theipi kung khat amu a, abul a hing pei a, ava et leh ana loungal bangma amu sih a, tuachi’n theipi kung kungah, “Kumtawn in na ga nawn sin” achi a, tuachi’n theipi kung avuoi paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nuazuiten tuakhu amu tah un, “Bangchidan a, theipi kung vuoi pai ahiei?” Chi’n lamdang asata mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Adihtahin ka hinghil ahi, ginna na nei ua, na ginlel sih pou u’leh, theipi tunga bawl bang giep na bawl sih ding ua, tam muol kungah zong na kisuon inlen tuipi sungah kipai lut in chi u’lachin zong na chi bang un a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh sil zousie gingta a, thu nget na toh na nget pouma uh na mu ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Ama Pasian bieh inn ah ahing lut a thu ahil laitah in, siempu liente leh nautaang upate akung ah ahing pei ua, “Bang thuneina nei a nang tam silte na bawl ahiei? Tualeh tam thuneina koi in ahing pieh ahiei?” Achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Ken zong thu khat ka hing dong ding hi, tuakhu na hing hil u’leh, ken zong koi thu a tam silte ka bawl ahiei ka hing hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johan Baptisma khu hei a hing kipan ahiei? Van a hing kipan ahiei, ahisihleh mihing a kipan ahiei?” chi’n adongta hi. Tualeh amaute “Akingaituo ua, van akipat chilei lah, Aman tua ahileh bang ding a, ama gingta lou? ahing chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing akipat chilei lah mipite igiing ngal a, mi zousie in Johan khu guolnei a asim zieh un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Jesu adawng ua, “Ka thei sih uhi,” achi uhi. Tuachi’n Aman zong akung uah, “Tam silte koi thuneina a ka bawl ahiei chi ka hing hil sih ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh “Nouten bang na chi ngai uoi? Mi khat in tapa ni anei a, amasa penpa kung ah ahing pei a, Tapa tuni in ka grep huon ah va kuon inlen nna vasem in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aman adawnga, kuon sih vang, achi a, hinanleh adachiengin alungsim aheng a akuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n a ninapa kungah ahing pei a, tuabangma in ava chita hi. Tualeh aman adawnga Pu aw kuon navang achi hi. Hinanleh akuonta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amautegel koizaw in apa uh deilam abawl uoi le?” achi hi. Amauten akungah “Amasazaw pen in,” achi uhi. Jesu’n akung uah, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, siedongte leh kizuaten Pasian gam ahing lut khal ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Johan khu dihtatna lam thu ah na kung uah ahing pei a, ama na gingta sih uhi, hinanleh siedongte leh kizuate’n ama agingta uhi; tualeh nouten tua khu na mu nua un zong ama na gintatna ding un, na kisia sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Gentethu dang ngaikhie un, gam neipa koi ahiei khat a um a, tua mipa’n grep huon khat abawl a, palin akimkot in a im a, tua sungah grep suhna khuh atou a, innsang alam a, tuachi’n grep huon bawl mite kungah kilaw a hou dingin apekhie a, gamdang gamlapi ah azinsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n aga law ahun ding kuonin, asuohte aga la dingin huon bawlmite kungah asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh huon bawlmite’n asuohte aman ua, khat avuo ua, khat athat ua, adang khat suongin asep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aman asuohte amasanga sanga tamzaw asawl kia a; amaute tung ah zong amasang ua mite abawl bangma un ana bawl kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n atawpna pen ah, ka tapa zatat ngei nava uh chiin atapa khu akung uah asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh huon bawlmite’n atapa amu tahun, Tam mipa khu gouluo ding pa ahi, hing pei un, that vai in, agouluo dingte kilah vai, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama aman ua, grep huon pulam ah apai ua, athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaziehin grep huon neipa ahing peitah chiengin tua huon bawlmite tungah bangchin angbawl diei le? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amauten akungah, “Aman tua migiloute khu genthei tahin asumang ding a, grep huon pen huon bawl midangte, aga law hun teng a, agate akunga pe zel dingte kungah kilaw a hou dingin ape ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Inn lammite suong deilou pen, Tuami ngel khu aning a suong poimaw pen ahing hita; Tami Mangpa bawl ahi a, imitmu un alamdang ahi, kichi laisiengthou khu, simkha ngailou na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian gam khu na kung ua kipat in ahing kilah pieh dinga, aga suo ding namte kunga pieh ahi ding, chi ka hing hil ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Tualeh tami suong tunga pua pouma akehjah dinga, tualeh anetkhahte pouma agawtguoi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh siempu liente leh Pharisaiten gente thute azah tah un, amauh tungthu gen ahi chi atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama mat atup chiengun, mipite agiing uhi, amaun Jesu khu guolnei a angai zieh un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n amauh ahoupi a, akung uah gentena thu agen kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Van gam khu leengpa koi ahiei in, atapa dinga kitenna annzaluina a bawl toh a gente hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh aman kitenna anzaluina a, chielte han dingin asuohte asawl a, hinanleh amaute ahing haw nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman asuoh dangte asawl kia a, chielte kung ah, Ngai un, ka anzalui ka manta a, ka bawngtalte leh ka gan vahthaute ka gouta a, bangma zousie mansa ahita, kitenna ankuong im dingin hing peita un, va chita un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun ana thusim sih ua, khat alou ah, khat asummet bawlna ah, akipeimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh adangten asuohte aman ua, simmawhuoi tahin abawl ua, athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa’n tua thu azah tahin alungthahta a, tualeh agalkapte asawl a, tua tuolthatte asumang a, akhopi uh ahaltum piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman asuohte kungah, kitenna ankuong mansa ahita, hinanleh ka chielte lah ne taah ahi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin lamkathuomte ah pei unlen, tualeh na mu taphot uh, kitenna ann ne dingin hing chiel un, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua suohte khu apawt ua, lamkathuomte a va pei in amu pouma uh, misie leh miphate zong abawn un ahing hankhawm ua, tualeh kitenna innsung khu michielte in ahing dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hinanleh leengpa khu michielte en dinga ahing lut leh, kitenna puon sillou mi khat khunah amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n akungah, Lawm bangchidan ahiei kitenna puon sillou a tana na hing lut? achi hi. Tualeh ama ahamta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n asuohte kungah, akhut leh akeng kaan unlen, pulam miel ah paidoh un, khunah kaa leh hagawina a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chielte tampi ahi ua, telte tawmnou ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharisaite apawtdoh ua, athugente apat amat theina dingun ava kikum khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh amaun anuazuite u’leh Herod pawlte akungah asawl ua, tua miten akungah, “Siepa midihtah na hia, Pasian lam thu dihtahin na hil a, khawh sahtuom koima na nei sih chi ka thei uhi, aziehpen koima khentuom na nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin hing hil in bang na chi ngai ei? Kaisar kunga sie pieh asieng ei, sieng lou?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n alungsim gitlou dan uh athei a, akung uah, nou milepchiete “Bangdinga kei hing ze et na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sie sum khu hing ensah un” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaun makhai khat akungah ahing tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Tami koi lim leh koi min ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaun akung ah “Kaisar” a achi uhi. Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Kaisar silte Kaisar kungah pie unlen, Pasian silte Pasian kungah pie un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaun tam thute azah tah un, lamdang asata ua, Ama anuasie ua, apei mangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuami ni main, Saddukaite, thawkiana aum sih chite Akungah ahing pei ua, Akung ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Siepa aw, Mosi in mi khat ta neilou a ashi leh, asanggampa’n azi aluo ding a, asanggampa dingin chi ahahpieh ding ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin ka kung uah, sanggam pasal sagi a um ua, tualeh a upa pen in zi anei a, ashita a, chihah anei lou zieh in azi pen a sanggampa kungah anuasieta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuamabangin anina pa zong ashi a, athumna pa in aluo a, asagina dongin akitenpi chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n atawpna pen ah, numeinu zong ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin thawkiana ah, amanu khu sagite lah ah koipen zi ahita diei? Abawn un akitenpi chiet ngal ua, chi’n adong uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Laisiengthou leh Pasian silbawltheina na theilou ziehun, na sukhiel leng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thawkiana ah kitenna aum nawn sih ding a, vansawlsiengte abang zawta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh mishi thawkiana thu a, Pasian in na kung ua agen khu simkha ngailou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kei Abraham Pasian, Isaak Pasian, leh Jakob Pasian ka hi, achi khu. Pasian khu mishi Pasian ahisih a, Mihing Pasian ahizaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten tam thu azah tah un, athuhilte lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n Saddukaite gen ding theilouin aniel dongta chi Pharisaiten azah tah un, ahing kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n alah ua dansiem mi khat in, Ama ze etna in thu khat adong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Siepa aw, dan thu ah thupieh lienpen bang ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Mangpa na Pasian khu na lungtang zousie in, na hagau zousie in, tualeh na lungsim zousie in, na it ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tami thupieh masa leh lienpen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Anina khu tambangma ahi a, Nangma na ki it bangin na inn vengte it in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tam dan thupieh tegel tungah, dan thu leh guolneite thu zousie akikhaikhawm sieng ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pharisaite akikhop lai un, Jesu’n amauh thu adong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khrist khu “Bang na chi ngai uoi? Koi tapa ahiei?” achi hi. Amaun “David tapa ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Tua ahileh bangchidan a, David in hagau a Ama khu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mangpa’n ka Mangpa kungah, Na melmate na kengtaw nuoi a, Ka koi masangsie’n, ka ziet langah touin, chia, Mangpa achi ahiei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />David in Ama khu Mangpa achi leh atapa bang achi hi diei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n koiman ama kam khat in zong adawng thei sih ua, tua ni akipat in koiman thu dang mawngmawng adong kia ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n mipite leh anuazuite kungah thu agen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Laigiel mite leh Pharisaite khu Mosi toupha ah atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin zui dinga ahing hil pouma uh zui unlen, bawl zel un, hinanleh amauh silbawl bang khu bawl sih un, amaun agen ua, abawl tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puohgih hasatah abawl ua mite liengkou ah apat ua, amaun lah akhutme khat un zong akhoi nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sil bawl zousie u’khu mihing mitmu ding a abawl uh ahi, asil bute u’leh alutang ua akopte uh asulien ua apuon mongte uh atuol sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawi bawlna ah mun hoipen, kikhopna inn ah touna nuom pen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Van zuana mun a miten chibai abuh ua, Rabbi, Rabbi, chia ahat u’bang a ut sese uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen Rabbi chiin um sih un, aziehpen na siepa uh khat a um, Khrist ngei khu ahi, tualeh noute pen sanggamta ngen na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitungah koima pa chi sih un, aziehpen na Pa uh khat ahia, Ama van ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siepa chiin um sih un, aziehpen na siepa uh khat a um hi, Khrist khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lah ua thupipen khu, na nasem ua a umzawh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh koipou akiliensah khu, suhneu ahi dinga tualeh koipou akingai neu khu tawisang in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Hinanleh nou laigielmite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tung uh agih hi van gam lampi mite na khah pieh ua, nouma lah na lut tuom sih ua, mi alut dingte lah na phal sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou laigiel mite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tung uh agih hi! Aziehpen meithai innte na negam ua, mi solna dingin thungetna sawtpi pi na nei ua; tuazieh in mawpaina liensem na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nou laigielmite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tung uh agih hi! Aziehpen phungkai khat bawl ding in, tuipi leh gam ah na zinkuol ua, ama na thuzawtah chieng un, ama khu noumate sanga ale nia gawtmun tapa in na bawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nou mitto lamkaite, koipou Pasian biehinn loua kichiem khu bangma ahisih a, hinanleh koipou Pasian biehinn a sana loua kichiem in, atangtun sah ding ahi chite aw, na tung uh agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nou mimaw leh mittote aw, sana leh sana siengthousah Pasian biehinn koizaw athupizaw ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh koipou maitam loua kichiem khu, bangma ahi sih, hinanleh atung a um silpieh loua kichiem in, atangtun sah ding ahi, na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nou mimo leh mittote aw, silpieh leh silpiehte susiengthou maitam khu, heipen thupizaw ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin koipou maitam loua kichiem pouma in maitam leh atunga um zousie louin akichiem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh koipou Pasian biehinn loua kichiem khu, Pasian biehinn leh asunga um zousie lou in akichiem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh van loua kichiem pouma khu, Pasian Mangtoupha leh atunga toupa lou a kichiem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Nou laigielmite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tung uh agih hi, aziehpen nouten leengmaselte leh pasikhawmte, tualeh Jirate, nangawn sawm a khat na pie ua, dan thu khawhzaw adih a thukhenna bang, khotuona leh gin umnate bang, na thusim sih uhi. Tamte ahi na bawl ding uh, adangte nelsie tuomlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nou lamkai mittote, thousi hisienga, sangawngsau pumvalte aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nou laigielmite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tunguh agih hi! Nouten nou leh kuong pulam na silsieng ua, hinanleh asung lah lepguhna leh kidehlounain adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nou Pharisai mittote aw, nou leh kuong sunglam susieng masa un, tuachi’n apulam zong ahing siengthei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Laigielmite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tunguh agih hi, noute pen han kizutngou apulam kilawmtah a kilang, asunglam lah mishi gu leh silnieh chintenga dim bang na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuabangmain noute zong pulam ah mihing mitmu in dihtat bangin na lang ua, hinanleh na sunglam uh khu lepchiena leh gitlouna in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Nou laigielmite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tunguh agih hi, aziehpen guolneite han na bawl ua, midihtatte han zong na zem uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tualeh, ka pu ka pate uh damlaia na um hi u’leng, guolneite sisan asuona uah telkha lou ding hi ve ung na chi phuat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaziehin guolneite thatte tate na hi uh chi nouma leh nouma na kitheisah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n na pu na pate uh gitlouna tena dan sudim vanglah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nou gulte leh gul suonte aw, gawtmun thukhenna bangchiin na pel thei ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaziehin, Ngai un, na kung uah guolneite, mipilte leh laigielmite, ka hing sawl ahi; alah ua kimkhatte na that ding ua, kros ah na khailia ding ua, kimkhatte na kikhopna innte uah, na jep ding ua, tualeh khochin ah na bawlgenthei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n midihtat Abel sisan kisuo apat, Pasian biehinn leh maitam kikal a Barakiah tapa Zekariah na tha uh sisan tandongin, leitunga midihtat sisan kisuo zousie na tung uah ahing tung thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, tam silte zousie tulai khangthate tungah ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Aw Jerusalem, Jerusalem, guolnei that a, na kunga ahing sawlte uh suonga na seplum! aapi in anoute ahalim nuoi a a opkhum bangin, ken zong na tate bangzatvei ahiei opkhum katum a, hinanleh na ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />En un, na inn uh ahawm a na kung ua nuasie in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na kung uah ka hinghil ahi, Mangpa min a hing pei ahampha hi na chi masangsie uh tukal na hing mu nawn sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu apawtdoh a, Pasian biehinn apat a apei lai in, Pasian biehinn kilamdan Ama ensah dingin anuazuite akungah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n akung uah, “Tam silte zousie na mu sih uh amah? Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, suhchip lou dinga suong kithuop mawngmawng tanah a um sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Olive muol tunga atou lai in, nuazuite amau’tang in akungah ahing pei ua, “Tam silte bangchih chiengin ahing um diei? Tualeh na hing pei kiana ding leh leitung tawpna ding chiemtena bang ahi diei?” hing hil in, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu’n amauh adawnga akung uah, “Koiman ahing sol louna dingin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi tampi in, Khrist ka hi, chiin Keima min in ahing pei ding ua, mi tampi asol zou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh kidouna leh kidouna thuthangte na za ding uhi. Na mangbat louna dingun pilvang un, tuate pen ahing tung ding mawng ahi, hinanleh atawpna ahi nai sih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nam tuom leh namtuom akidou ding ua, gam tuom leh gam tuom akidou ding ua, tualeh mun tuom tuom ah kiel atung ding a, natna hi aleeng dinga, zil aling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamte zousie khu gentheina kipatna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua hun chiengin noute genthei thuoh dingin ahing mansah ding ua, ahing thatlum ding ua, tualeh ka min ziehin nam zousie huot na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh mi tampi apua ding ua, khat leh khat akimansah ding ua, khat leh khat akimuda ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuahun chiengin guolnei tahlou tampi ahing pawtdoh ding ua, mi tampi asol zou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh gitlouna apun ding ziehin ki itna adai deu deu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh atawp donga thuohzou pouma hundamin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh tami leenggam khantanhoi khu nam zousie theisahna dingin, leitung pumpi ah hilin a um dinga, tuazou chiengin atawpna ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuazieh in sumangthaipa kidahhuoi, guolnei Daniel in ana genpa, mun siengthou a hing ding na mu chieng un (asim pouma in theisiem uheh.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin Judia gam a umte taangte ah tai uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Inn tunga umte zong, a inn sung a bang ahiei ladoh dingin hing kumsuh sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lou a umte zong, apuonsilte la dingin hing nuakia sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin agaite leh naungeh neite tung agih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na taimang hun ding uh phalbi lai leh khawlni ahi louna dingin thungen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen tua hun chiengin gimthuohna huoisetah um ding ahi, tuabanga gimthuohna huoisie khu leitung siemchil apat tuni tandongin a um ngai nai sih a, um zong a umkia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua nite khu suhtom hisihleh mihing mawngmawng ahinga hutdoh ahi sih ding hi, hinanleh telte zieh in tua nite suhtom ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin, mi koipou in na kung ua, En vawi tanah Khrist a um hi, ahisihleh khunah a um hi, chinan uleh tahsang sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen Khrist tahlou leh guolnei tahlou ahing pawt dinga, chiemtena leh sil lamdangte hing ensah in ahing sol ding uhi; tuaten hithei liei leh telte nangawn zong asol ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai un, ka hing hil masah na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuazieh in, na kung ua, En vawi, gamdai ah aum, ahing chi u’leh peidoh sih un, En un, pindan sung tawngah a um achi u’leh zong tahsang tuom sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Suohlam a tunphe ahing pheta tumlam dong asalvah bangin, Mihing Tapa hing pei kiana zong tuabangma ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Heisung hinanleh shiluong umna phot ah Langtate zong a um khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Gimthuohna nite zoutah chiengin, ni suhmiel in a um dinga, hapi zong avah nawnsih ding hi, van a kipat in aasite ake ding a, tualeh van silbawltheinate suhling ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin van ah Mihing Tapa chiemtena ahing kilang dinga, tua hun chiengin, leitung nam zousie in asuun ding uhi, tualeh Mihing Tapa khu silbawltheina leh guolzawna thupitah toh van meilum tunga hing pei amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh avansawlsiengte pengkul ging ngai thupitah toh ahing sawl dinga, amaun lei ning li a kipat leh van mong langkhat akipat alangkhat dongin, atelte akhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tuachi’n theipi kungah gentena thu zil un: Abate ahing men a, anate ahing selnou chiengin, nipi anaita chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachimabangin nouten zong tam silte na mu chieng un, Ama ahing naita a, kotkha bul mama ah aumta hi chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chitahtahin Ka hing hil ahi, Tam silte zousie atunkim masangsie’n tulai khangthate amang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lei leh van amang dinga, hinanleh ka thu amang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Hinanleh tua ni leh ahun ding thu khu, koiman athei sih a, van a vansawlsiengte leh Tapa nangawn in zong athei sih a, hinanleh ka Pa maimai in athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Noah damlai mabangin, Mihing Tapa hing pei kiana zong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuani a tuichim tun masangin Noah kuong sunga alut ni dongin, ane un adawn ua, zi leh pasalin a kinei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tualeh tuichim ahing tunga, abawn ua alahmang masangsiein bangma athei sih uhi; Mihing Tapa hing pei kiana zong tuabang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin lou ah mi ni a um ding ua, khat lahmang in a um ding a, khatpen nuasie ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Numei ni ann sukhawm in a um ding ua, khat lahmangin a um ding a, khat pen akinuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuazieh in kiging un, na Mangpa uh bangchih hun a hing pei ding ahiei chi na theilou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hinanleh tami thei un, inn neipa’n guta hing pei ding hun thei leh, aveng ding a, a inn aphetvang sah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuazieh in noute zong kiging zing un, na gintat lou hun laitah ua, Mihing Tapa hing pei ding ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Suoh muonhuoi, pil tah apu in ahun chin a, atan ding uh hawmpieh dinga, a innkuonpite tunga houtu dinga, akoi khu koi ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Apu ahing pei chieng a, tuabanga bawla ahing mu, tua suohpa khu ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, aman tua suohpa khu anei zousie tunga vaihawm in apangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hinanleh suoh gilou in alungsim in Ka pu hing tung pai zuai sih nava, chiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />asuoh hipite na vuoin, zukham annkhamte toh na ne in na dawnkhawmta leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />tua suohpa pu khu, agintat lou ni, akiven lou laitahin ahing tung ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />tua suohpa khu tun ni asuo dinga, milepchiete tan bangbang atangsah dinga, khunah ka leh ha gawt a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua hun chiengin van gam khu nungah siengthou sawm, athaumeite uh kenga mouneipa dawn dinga, kuonte toh gente ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Alah ua ngate apil ua, ngate amo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amoten athaumei uh a keng ua, athautui akengtel sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh apilte in pen athaumei utoh a athawl ah atui zong akengtel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mouneipa ahing vaigei zieh in, abawn un alusu ua ana imuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh zankim lai in, Ngai un, mouneipa ahing pei hi, adawn dingin hing pawt un, chi kikou ging akizata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua nungahte athou chiet ua, athaumeite uh ade chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh amoten apilte kungah, na thautui uh hing hawm un, ka thaumeite uh mit ding ahita hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh apilten adawng ua, kou a ding leh noute a dingin akiching sih ding hi, azuate kungah pei unlen va leizaw un, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh alei dinga ava pei lahkal un, mouneipa khu ahing tungta a, tuachi’n kigingsa a na umte khu moulopna inn ah ama toh alutkhawm ua, tuachi’n kot akikhata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum nuain nungah siengthou dangte zong ahing tung ua, Mangpa, Mangpa kot hing honin achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman adawnga, adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, noute ka hing theikha ngai sih hi, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin kiging un, Mihing Tapa hing peina ding ni leh ahun na theilou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Van gam khu mi khat, gamdang gamlatah a, khuolzin dinga kisa, asuohte hankhawm a, aneisate akhut ua kemsah bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asuohpa khat kungah talent nga, asuoh dangkhat kungah talent ni, tualeh asuoh dang khat kungah talent khat apie a, amauh bawlthei hun ding chiet apie hi, tuazouin ama azinkhe pai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n talent nga tangpa’n tuateng toh summet ava bawl pai a, talent nga dang amube hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabangma in talent ni tangpa’n zong talent ni dang a mube hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh talent khat tangpa pen apei a lei ava tou a, apu sum ava phumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hun sawtpi nuain tua suohte pu khu ahing tungta a, tualeh amautoh atuotkhawm ua asutupta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n talent nga tangpa ahing pei a, talent nga dang ahing tawi a, Pu aw, nang talent nga na hing kemsah a, En vawi, talent nga dang ka mu be hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Apuin akungah, Suoh hoi leh muonhuoi, na bawl hoi hi, sil tawmnou tungah na muonhuoi a, sil tampi tung a vaihawm in ka hing koi ding hi. Na pu kipahna ah lut in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Talent ni tangpa zong ahing pei a, Pu aw, nang talent ni na hing kemsah a, en vawi, talent ni dang ka mu be hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Apu’n akungah, suoh hoi leh muonhuoi, na bawl hoi hi, sil tawmnou khat tungah na muonhuoi a, sil tampi tunga vaihawm ding in ka hing koi ding hi. Na pu kipahna ah lut in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n talent khat tangpa zong ahing pei a, pu aw, migenhapi na hi chi ka hing thei a, na tu louna ah zong na at kuom a, haichi na thelouna ah zong na khawm zel hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka zau a, ka va pei a na talent lei nuoi ah ka phuolta hi, En vawi, tanah nanga ma na mukiata hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A puin adawnga, akungah, Nang suoh gilou leh thasepa, Ka tu louna ah ka at a, ka thelouna ah ka lakhawm zel hi, chi na thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuabang ahivanglah leh ka sum khu sum kemte kungah na koi lachin, ka hing tun chienga, ka sum apung toh mu ngel ding hivengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin atalent khu lahpieh unlen, talent sawm neipa kung ah pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Koipou anei khu piehbelap ahi dinga, tampi ahing nei ding hi, hinanleh koipou anei lou khu anei sun zong lahpieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh suoh phatuomlou khu pulam miel ah paidoh unlen, khunah ka leh ha gawtna a um ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa khu vansawlsiengthoute zousie toh athupina a, ahing pei chiengin Ama khu aleengtoupha tungah atou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nam zousie amasangah akikhawm ding ua, belamchingpa’n kel lah a, abelamte akhenkhieh bangin, amauh akhenkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Belamte khu aziet lam ah akoi dinga, kelte pen aveilam ah akoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin leengpa’n azietlam a mite kungah, nou ka Pa thuphangate aw, hing pei unlen leitung siemchil akipata noute dinga kibawlsa leenggam khu luo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aziehpen, ka gil akiel in nouten ann na hing pie ua; ka dang ata in dawn ding na hing pie uhi; mikhuol ka hi in na hing zintun ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Guohtanga ka um in, puon na hing silsah ua, damlou a ka um in, na hing ve ua, suongkul a ka tanin, ka kungah na hing haw uhi, achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin midihtatten, Mangpa bangchih in ahiei gilkiel a ka hing mu ua, ann ka hing pieh uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bangchihin ahiei mikhuol a ka hing mu ua, ka hing na zintun uh? Guohtanga ka hing mu ua puon ka hing silsah uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bangchih in ahiei china ahiei a, ahisihleh suongkul a ka hing mu ua, na kunga ka hing haw uh? Chi’n adong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n adawng ding a, akung uah, chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, Tam ka sanggamte lah a neupen khat tunga na bawl u’khu ka tunga bawl na hi uh, achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuazou chiengin aveilam a mite kungah, nou hamsethuohte aw, ka kung apat peimang unlen, kumtawn meidil, dawimangpa leh asawltahte dinga abawl uah, lut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aziehpen ka gilkiel in, ann na hing pe sih ua, ka dangtain, dawn ding na hing pe sih ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mikhuol ka hiin, na hing zintun sih ua, guohtang ka hiin, puon na hing silsah sih ua, ka chinat leh suongkul a, ka taan in na hing ve sih uhi, achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun zong, Mangpa bangchihin ahiei, gilkiel ahiei, guohtangin ahiei, china in ahiei, suongkul ah ahiei, ka hing mu ua, na nna ka hing seppieh lou uh? Chiin adawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akung uah, chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi, Tam mineupente lah a, mi khat tunga na bawl lou u’khu, ka tunga bawllou na hi uhi, chiin adawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh tuate khu kumtawn gawtmun ah apeita ding ua, hinanleh midihtatte pen kumtawn hinna ah a peita ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu’n tam thu zousie agen zou in anuazuite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ni ni nua chiengin peikan annkuong luina a um ding a, Mihing Tapa kilbeh dinga, matsahin a um ding hi,” chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hun laitah in siempu liente, laigielmite leh vantang upate khu siempu lienpen Kaiapha kichipa innpi ah akikhawm ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu khu solbawla man a atha theina ding un akikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ahivang in pawi niin vang hida heh, tuachilouin mipite lah ah buoina hing pieng khava achi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu khu Bethani khuo a mi phahpa Simon inn a aum laitah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Numei khat alabastar bawm a thau namtui manphatah tawiin akungah ahing pei a, a annkuong im laitah in Jesu lu tungah a buohsuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh anuazuiten tuakhu a mutah un, alungthah ua, “Bangdinga ahichi suhmangthai ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam sathau namtui man tamtah a zua a, mi zawngte kunga pieh thei hingel hia,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu’n tuakhu atheitahin akung uah, “Bangdinga tam numeinu subuoi na hi uoi? Amanu’n ka tung ah sil hoi abawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen mi zawngte na kung uah, a um ngitnget uhi, hinanleh Kei pen na kung ua um ngitnget ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami thau namtui ka tahsa tung a asun khu vui a ka um ni a dinga abawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chitahtah in ka hing hil ahi; leitung pumpi heisung mun ah zong, tam khantanhoi kigenna phot ah, tam numeinu silbawl zong amanu thei zingna dingin akigen zel ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n sawmlenite lah a khat, Juda Iskariot kichipa khu siempu liente kungah ava haw a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akung uah, “Ama hing mansah ta leng, kei bang na hing pe ding uoi?” ava chi hi. Tuachi’n amaun dangka sawmthum, asim ua apeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum ni akipat in Ama matsahna ding hun lemtang asuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tanghou tolsawlou pawi ni masapen in, nuazuite Jesu kungah ahing pei ua, akungah, “Peikan annkuong na nehna ding heisung ah hing bawlpieh u’leng na ut ei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh, Aman “Khopi ah pei unlen, mi koi ahiei khat kungah, Siepipa’n ka hun anaita a, ka nuazuite toh na inn ah peikan annkuong ka nekhawm ding uh, achi hi, va chi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazuiten Jesu’n ahil bangin ava bawl ua, Peikan annkuong abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nitahlam ahing hiin, nuazui sawm leh nite toh annkuong a im ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ann aneh laitah un Aman akung uah, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, na lah ua mi khat in kei ahing mansah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amauh alungdong mamata ua, akungah “Mangpa kei ka hi amaleh?” achi chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman, “Kei toh annkuong sohkhawmpa mama in ahing zuousan ding a, ahing mansah ding hi, chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing Tapa khu atanchin kigiel bangin apei zel ding hi, hinanleh Mihing Tapa mansah dingpa tung agih hi! Tuapa khu ana pienglou hileh ama dingin ahoizaw ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amansah dingpa Juda in, “Siepa kei ka hi amah?” achi a, Aman akungah “Nangma’n na genta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh ann aneh lai un, Jesu’n tanghou ala a, aguolzawl a, aphalsuo a, tualeh anuazuite apie a, “La unlen, ne un, tami ka tahsa ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n nou ala a, kipahthu agen a, akung uah apie a, “Na bawn un tami dawn un”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami ka sisan, khelnate ngaidamna dinga mi tampite dinga luongkhie thuhun tha khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hing hil ahi, Ka Pa gam a noute toh atha a ka dawn ni atun masangsie tuban grepgui a ga ka dawn kia nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh la khat asah zou un, apawt ua, Olive muol ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Tuzan chiengin na bawn un keima zieh in na lungke sieng ding uhi, aziehpen: Belampu ka jep dinga, Belamhon lah a belamte akithethang ding uh, chi gel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh ka thawkia nua chiengin, Galili gam ah na masang uah ka pei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Peter in adawnga akungah, “Mi zousie na tung ah lungke sieng nan uleh, keivang ka lung kesih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, tuzan chiengin aah khuon masang in thum vei na hing kitheimawbawl ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Peter in akungah, “Nang toh shi khawm ding hinanleng zong ka hing kitheimawbawl sih ding hi,” achi hi. Tuabangmain nuazuite zousie in zong achi chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu amautoh Gethsemani achina mun uah atung a, tualeh nuazuite kungah, “Khuna kava thunget lahkaal in tanah na tou un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Aman Peter leh Zebedi tapate ni azawpi a, alunggim sengin achimaw panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Ka hinna shina khopin alunggim mama hi, tanah um unlen, hing venpi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Themkhat a gamla zaw deu ah apei a, Amai tuolsu in akhupboh a, “Ka Pa Aw, ahitheileh tam nouin hing pelsah in, Ahivang in Keima thu hilouin Nangma thuthu hizaw heh,” chiin thu angen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuazouin nuazuite kungah ahing pei a, amauh imu in ahing muta a, “Tualeh Peter kungah nouten naikaal khat zong hing venpi zoulou na hi uh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Solna a na lut louna dingun kiging ngitnget in thungen un, hagau in angap a, hinanleh tahsa pen ahat sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aniveina ah ava pei a thu angen kia a, “Pa Aw ka dawn lou a tami nouin hing pel thei mama lou ahitah leh Nangma thuthu hi heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh ahing pei kia a, amauh imu in amu kia a, aziehpen a imut suoh mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n, amauh anuasie a, ava pei kia a, athum veina ah agen ngaiteng gen in, thu angen kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuazouin a nuazuite kungah ahing pei a, akung uah, “Tu dong a i mu na lai a, na khawldam na hi nalai uh amah? Ngai un, ahun ahing tungta hi. Mihing Tapa migiloute khut ah matsah ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Thou unlen pei vai, En un, ahing mansah dingpa ahing tungta hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A thugen lai mamain, En vawi, sawm leh nite lah a khat, Juda khu, siempu liente leh upate kunga kipat, mipi tampi namsau leh khetbuh tawite toh ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh amansah ding pa’n chiemtena ahil masa a, “Ka tawp penpen khu Ama ahi dinga, na man pai ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n Jesu azuontou pai a, “Salam Siepa!” achi a, Ama atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n akungah, “Lawm, bangdinga hing pei na hiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n amauh ang pei ua, Jesu tungah khut aha ua amanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh thakhat in, Jesu umpite laha mi khat in akhutin asawh a, anamsau adohkhie a, siempulien suohpa asat a, abil asatkhieh pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Na namsau apai ah siet kia in, namsau pan pouma namsau ma a, shi ding ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuin zong, vansawlsieng tulguh mun sawmleni sang a tamzaw hing sawl ding a, Ka Pa kunga ngen theilou a hing ngaisut na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hinanleh tuabangin ngenta leng, Laisiengthou in tambangin ahing um ngeingei ding, achi khu bang achi tang tun thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tua hun laitah main Jesu’n mipite kung ah, “Suomhat khat man ding bang zenin, namsau leh khetbuh tawi in, Kei man ding in na hing kuon u’maw? Nichin in Pasian bieh inn ah thuhil in ka tou a, na hing man sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Hinanleh guolneite laisiengthou thute ahing tangtun theina dinga tamte zousie hing um ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n nuazuite zousiein Ama anuasie ua ataimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu mante’n Ama khu siempu lienpen Kaiapha inn a, laigiel mite leh upate kikhopna ah azawpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in gamla simkhat ah siempu lien inn huongsung dong Jesu azui a, tualeh ava lut a atawptan thei tum in vengmite lah ah ava tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tualeh siempu liente, upate leh vaihawm mite zousie in, Jesu atha theina ding un, theipimi dihlou asui ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />hinanleh amu sih uhi. Theipimi dihlou tampi ahing pei vang un koiman a mu zou tuom sih uhi. Hinanleh atawp ah theipimi dihlou ni ahing pei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“Tam mipa’n Pasian biehinn susiet a ni thum sunga lam kia thei ka hi, achi hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu lienpen adingdoh a, Akungah “Adawnna ding bangma theilou na hiei mah? Tam mite hing hehna bangchidan ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu aham vawt sih hi. Tuachi’n siempu lienpen in akungah, “Pasian hing min in ka hing vau ahi, Pasian Tapa Khrist na hileh hilou hing hil in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Na chita hi. Ahivang in ka hing hil ahi, Tunua chiengin Mihing Tapa silbawltheina zietlam a tou leh van meilum tunga hing pei na mu ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuatah in Siempu lienpen in apuonte abotkeh a, “Pasian agenseta, theipimi dang bangding ichi nalai diei? Ngai un, tuin Pasian agensietna na zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Bang nachi ngai uoi?” Amauten adawng ua, “Shi taah ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amaitang ah chil asietkhum ua, avuo ua, kimkhatten akhutpeh un abengthop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Nang Khrist, koi ahiei ahing beng?” hing hil in, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Tualeh Peter khu inn pulam huong sungah atou a, tualeh nungah khat akungah ahing pei a, “Nang zong Galili mi, Jesu toh umkhawm na hive maw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hinanleh aman “Na thugen thei vawt sing chi’n amauh zousie mai ah akilepsanta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tualeh kotlam bihaliep a apei laitah in, nungah dang khat in ana mu a, khuna umte kungah, “Tam mipa zong, Nazareth Jesu kunga um ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Tuapa vang ka theikha sih,” chia kichiem in akilepsan kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tualeh tomkhat zouin akiim a dingte ahing pei ua, Peter kungah, “Nang zong alah ua khat na hi ngel ve, aziehpen na kamsuoin akithei hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Tua mipa ka theikha ngai mawngmawng sih hi,” chiin amaleh ama awsie kilawkhumin akichiemta hi. Tuachi’n a khuong paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Tualeh Peter in Jesu thugen, “A khuon masangin thumvei na hing kilepsan ding achi khu ahing theidohta hi.” Tuachi’n pulam ah apawtdoh a, hasetahin akapta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingmawng ahing hitahin, siempu liente leh vantang upate zousie Jesu thana ding thu akikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Ama akaan ua, azawpi ua, gam uhpipa Pontius Pilat kungah apekheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama mansahpa Judas in Jesu amawpaita uh chi atheitahin akisia a, dangka sawmthum khu siempu liente leh upate kungah, ahing tawi kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mawna neilou sisan ka matsah khu ka khielta hi,” ava chi hi. Tualeh amaun “Kou a dingin bang akhoh diei? Nang na lawlaw kilawin achisanta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman dangka khu Pasian biehinn sungah aseplut a, apei a, ava awhlumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh siempu lienten dangka khu ala ua, “Tampen sisan man ahiziehin thawlawm bawm a koi asieng sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh akikumkhawm ua, mikhuolte vuina dingin tua sumin belkhengpa mun aleita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin khum mun khu tutan in, sisan mun achita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Jeremiah thugen, “Israel tate lah a koite ahiei in ana sah uh, Ama man ding dangka sawmthum khu ala ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n ahing hil bangin, belkhengmi mun man dingin apie uh achi khu hing tangtung ta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu gam uhpipa mai ah adinga tualeh gam uhpipa’n, “Nang Judate leengpa na hiei mah?” Chiin adonga, tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Na genta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh siempu liente leh upaten ahehsiet laitah un, bangma in adawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in akungah, “Ahing hehsietna tengpi uh zalou na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Aman kamteng khat in zong adawng sih hi, tuachi’n gam uhpipa’n lamdang asa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh pawi bawl ni chiengin gam uhpipa in henta khat, mipiten adeidei uh, ngaina dan in ahakhiet pieh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh khum hun laitah in henta minthangtah Baraba kichi mi khat anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute ahing kikhop tah un, Pilat in akung uah, “Koizaw hing hadoh leng na ut uoi? Baraba ahiei ahisihleh Jesu Khrist kichipa?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thangsietna zieh a amatsah uh ahi chi aman athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaihawmna toupha a atou laiin, azi in akungah mi asawl a, “Tua midih tungah bangma bawl sin, tuniin Ama ziehin ka mangin sil tampi ka thuoh hi ava chisah hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh siempu liente leh upaten Baraba khu ngen ua Jesu thatlum dingin mipite asol lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gam uhpipa’n amauh ahoupi a, “Nite lah a koizaw hing hakha leng chi na hi uoi,” achi a; Amaun Baraba, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilat in akung uah, “Ahileh Jesu Khrist kichi bang ka lawta diei le?” achi hi. Abawnpi un “Ama pen kross ah kilbeh in um heh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n gam uhpipa’n bang dingin e? “Bang bawl khiel anei a ahiei?” achi hi. Amauten abawn un, “Kross ah kilbehin um heh,” chiin akikou nasa semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pilat in bangma alaw thei sih a, hing buoi deudeu ding hi chi atheitah in, tui ala a, mipite mai a akhut sil in, “Tam midih sisan ah mawna ka nei sih hi, nouten na lawlaw kilawta un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite zousie in, “Asisan pen kouma leh ka tate uh tung ah tu heh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Baraba khu akung uah, ahakheta a, tualeh Jesu ajep a, kilbeh dingin apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuazou in gam uhpipa galkapten Jesu khu innpi huong sungah apuilut ua, apawlpawla um galkap zousie akimkot ah ahing kikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Apuonsilte ahawhkhiet pieh ua, puonsandup asilsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh linglukhu aphan ua, akhusah ua, akhut ziet langah pumpeng chiengkhut khat atawisah ua, amai ah akhupdin ua, “Salam Judate leengpa!” Chi’n chiemmui bawlnan anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n atungah chil asietkhum ua, pumpeng chiengkhut alahpieh ua, alutang satnain anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama chiemmui bawlna a anei zou un, puonsandup khu ahawhkhiet pieh ua, Ama puonte asilsah kia ua, Kross a kilbeh dingin apuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahing pawtdoh lai un, Sairin khuo a mi amin Simon kichi mi khat a mu ua, ama khu Kross paw dingin aman uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Golgotha kichi mun ahing tun tah un, (tuakhu lugu mun china ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Uain thua, silkha toh kihal dawn ding in apie ua, Aman tua khu achiem a, adawn nuom tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama Kross ah akhenbeh ua, tualeh aisanna in apuonsilte akihawm uhi; guolnei in, Ka puonte akihawm ua, ka puonsil tung ah ai asan uhi, chia anagen atangtunna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh khunah atou ua, Ama avengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh ahehsietna uh, “TAMI JUDATE LENGPA JESU AHI”, chia kigiel alutung ah atahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Ama toh suomhat mi ni zong akilbeh ua, azietlam ah khat, aveilam ah khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh akunga suohkha poumain, alu uh thing in, a elhou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Nang Pasian biehinn susie a, ni thum sunga lam kiapa, nangleh nang kihunkhe ve, Pasian tapa na hileh hing kumkhie in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuamabangin siempu liente, laigielmite leh upaten zong, a enghou uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Aman midangte ahundam a, Ama leh Ama akihundam thei sih hi. Israelte leengpa ahileh kross dawn apat hing kum leh asih diei, tuahileh Ama i gingta mai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aman Pasian amuong vele, Ama aut leh tuin hundam leh aveleh, Pasian tapa ka hi achi hilou i,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Suomhat Ama toh akilbehte un zong, tuamabangin a elhou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sunkim akipat in nitahlam nai thum dongin leitung pumpi ahing mielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh nai thum ding vel in Jesu aw ngaitah in akikou a, “Eloi Eloi lama Sabakthani?” tuakhu “Ka Pasian Ka Pasian bangdinga hing taisan na hei?” china ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Khuna akunga dingten tuakhu azah tahun “Tam mipa’n Elijah ahan hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Alah ua mi khat atai pai a, Spanji khat ala a, uoin thua ah adie a, pumpeng chieng dawnah ata a, dawn dingin ape tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Adangten Amatangin umsah un, “Ama hunkhe dingin Elijah ahing pei mawng ei mah enva ui,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu aw ngaitahin akikou kia a, ahagau ahata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai un, Pasian biehinn puonjah khu, atunglam apat in anuoilam dongin phal ni kisuoin akehsuoh a, zilpi ahing ling a, suongpite ahing pohkeh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />tualeh hante ahing kihong a, misiengthou imusate tahsa tampi kaithawin a umta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />tuate Ama thawkia nuain hante apat hing pawtdoh in khopi siengthou ah alut ua, mi tampi kungah akilah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap za lamkaipa leh Jesu venga umten zilling leh sil umdante amu un, azauta mama ua, “Tam Mipa Pasian Tapa dihtah ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tualeh khunah numei tampi ana seppieh kawm zela Galili gam akipata hing zuite aum ua, gamlapi ah a en ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />tuate lah ah Mari Magdalene, Jakob leh Joseph nu, Mari, tualeh Zebedi tate nu, a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nitahlam ahing hitah in, Arimathai khuo a um Jesu nuazui khat, amin Joseph, mi hausa khat ahing pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />tua mipa khu Pilat kungah ava pei a, Jesu luong angen hi. Tuachi’n Pilat in aluong khu pieh ding thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tualeh Joseph in aluong khu ala a, diel puon nemtahin atuom a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />ahantha suongkhuoh hawm sung ah, asiel a, tualeh hankot ah suong lienpi khat alia lut a apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tualeh Mari Magdalene leh Mari dang khat han mazawn ah atou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Azingni, tuakhu kiginni zing ni ahia, siempu liente leh Pharisaite Pilat kungah ahing kikhawm ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />“Pu, tua misolhatpa’n adamlai in, Ni thum nuain Ka thoukia ding achi ka theizing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuaziehin han khu anithum ni tan hoitah a veng dingin thu pie in, tuachilouinvang zanlaiin anua zuiten ava gu khading ua, mipite lah ah, mishi lah akipat in athou kiata achi khading uhi; tuachi’n solna nukhia zaw khu amasa sangin asezaw khading hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Pilat in akung uah, “Vengmi galkapte na nei ve ua le, pei unlen, na theitawp un veng hoisah ta un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tuachi’n vengmi galkapte toh apei ua, han khu a enchien ua, a suong achiemte ua, vengmi akoita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawlni beizou, nipikaal khat a ani masapen ding khovah kuonin, Mari Magdalene leh Mari dang han en dingin akuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, zil nasatah in alinga; Mangpa vansawlsieng van akipat in ahing kumsuh a, suong khu aliakhie a, atungah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amel lat dan khu kawlphe bang ahi a, apuonsilte vua bangin avaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama agiin zieh un vengmite khu achitun ua, mishi bangin aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh vansawlsiengin numeite ahoupi a, akung uah “Zausih un; Jesu kilbeh a umpa sui na hi uh chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama tanah a um nawn sih hi, agensa bangin Ama athouta hi. Alupna mun hing en vawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh kintah in pei unlen, Anuazuite kungah, mishi laha kipat in athoukiata; tualeh Ngai un, Galili gam ah na masang uah apei hi, tua mun ah Ama na mu ding uh, chi’n va hil un. Ngai un, Ka hing hilzouta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun thakhat in zau leh kipah mama kawmin han anuasie ua, anuazuite hil dingin ataita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anua zuite hil ding a apei lai un, Ngai vawi, Jesu’n amauh ana kituohpi a, “Nuom un!” achi hi. Tualeh amauh ahing pei ua akeng atu ua, abeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Zau sih unlen ka sanggamte Galili gam a pei dingin va hil un, khunah kei ahing mu ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh amauh apei lai un, Ngai vawi, vengmite lawikhat khopi sungah ahing lut ua, siempu liente kung ah, sil umdan zousie ava hilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siempu liente upate toh akikhawm ua, akikup khawm zou un, galkapte kungah sum tampi apie ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />akung uah, “Zanlai ka imut kaal un, anuazuite ahing pei ua, Ama ana gumangta uhi chi un, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gam uhpipa’n ana zahkhah tahleh, Kouman ama ka sulungkim ding ua, noute na bit nading uhi” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n sum khu ala ua, ahil bangbang un abawlta ua, tuachi’n tam thu khu Judamite lah ah tuni tan in tambangin akigen nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n nuazui sawm leh khatte khu Galili gam a Jesu’n aguotpiehna muol ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Ama amu tah un abie ua, hinanleh kimkhatten aginglel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu akung ua hing peiin, amauh ahoupi a, “Van leh lei a thuneina zousie ka kunga pieh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuazieh in pei unlen, namchin apat nuazui ding bawl unlen, Pa leh Tapa leh Hagausiengthou min in baptis unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />thu ka hing piehte zousie zui dingin thu hil un, tualeh ngai un, Kei bangchih tan in, leitung tawp dongin na kung uah ka um ding hi, achi hi.” Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
